  <para style="h">Mariko</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ubutumwa Bwiza uko bwanditswe na Mariko</para>
  <para style="toc2">Mariko</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mrk</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ubutumwa Bwiza uko bwanditswe na</para>
  <para style="mt1">Mariko</para>
  <para style="ie" />
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MRK 1" />
  <para style="s1">Yohana Umubatizi ategurira inzira Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 1:1" />Iyi ni yo ntango y’Ubutumwa Bwiza bwa Yesu Kristo, Umwana w’Imana. <verse eid="MRK 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 1:2" />Bwatanguye nk’uko vyari vyaranditswe n’uwavugishwa n’Imana Yesaya ngo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:2">“Ngira ndungike intumwa yanje imbere yawe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 1:2">igutegurire inzira”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAL 3:1">Malaki 3:1</ref></char></char></note>:<verse eid="MRK 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 1:3" />Uwo ni “Ijwi ry’uwusemerera mu bugaragwa, ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:3">‘Nimutegurire Uhoraho aho aca,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 1:3">mugorore inzira agenderamwo.’ ”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 40:3">Yesaya 40:3</ref></char></char></note><verse eid="MRK 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 1:4" />Uko ni ko Yohana Umubatizi yaserutse mu bugaragwa yigisha umubatizo wo kwihana ngo abantu baharirwe ivyaha. <verse eid="MRK 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 1:5" />Abantu benshi baragenda bavuye mu ntara ya Yudaya no mu gisagara ca Yerusalemu bakaja iyo ari. Bamaze kwatura ivyaha vyabo, yaca ababatiza mu ruzi Yorodani. <verse eid="MRK 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 1:6" />Yohana yambara impuzu ikozwe mu bwoya bw’ingamiya, akayikenyeza umukanda w’urusato mu rukenyerero. Ivyokurya vyiwe vyari inzige n’ubuki bwo mw’ishamba. <verse eid="MRK 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 1:7" />Yigisha avuga ati: “Uwuje inyuma yanje arandusha ubushobozi ku buryo bitanambereye kwunama ngo mpfundurure utugozi tw’ibirato vyiwe. <verse eid="MRK 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 1:8" />Jewe ndababatiza mu mazi, ariko we azobabatiza muri Mpwemu Yera.”<verse eid="MRK 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ukubatizwa kwa Yesu n’ukugeragezwa kwiwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 1:9" />Muri ico gihe, Yesu ava i Nazareti mu ntara y’i Galilaya, aja ku ruzi Yorodani, abatizwa na Yohana. <verse eid="MRK 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 1:10" />Akiva mu mazi, abona ijuru ryugurutse, Mpwemu Yera amuzako asa n’inuma. <verse eid="MRK 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 1:11" />Maze ijwi ryumvikana rivuye mw’ijuru riti: “Uri Umwana wanje nkunda, akampimbara.”<verse eid="MRK 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 1:12" />Muri ako kanya nyene, Mpwemu Yera aca ajana Yesu mu bugaragwa, <verse eid="MRK 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 1:13" />ahamara imisi mirongo ine ageragezwa na Satani. Yabana n’ibikoko vyo mw’ishamba, kandi abamarayika bakaza bakamukorera.<verse eid="MRK 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu ahamagara abigishwa biwe ba mbere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 1:14" />Yohana amaze gutabwa mw’ibohero, Yesu aca aja i Galilaya avuga Ubutumwa Bwiza bw’Imana, <verse eid="MRK 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 1:15" />ati: “Igihe kirashitse, Ubwami bw’Imana buri hafi. Nimwihane mwizere Ubutumwa Bwiza.”<verse eid="MRK 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 1:16" />Umusi umwe, Yesu ariko aragendagenda ku nkengera y’ikiyaga c’i Galilaya, abona Simoni na mwene nyina Andereya, bariko baterera urusenga mu kiyaga, kuko bari abarovyi. <verse eid="MRK 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 1:17" />Arababwira ati: <char style="wj">“Nimunkurikire, nzobagira abarovyi b’abantu.”</char> <verse eid="MRK 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 1:18" />Ubwo nyene baca basiga ngaho insenga zabo, baramukurikira.<verse eid="MRK 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 1:19" />Yigiye imbere gato, abona Yakobo na Yohana bene Zebedayo bariko barasana insenga zabo mu bwato. <verse eid="MRK 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 1:20" />Ubwo nyene aca arabahamagara, na bo basiga se Zebedayo n’abakozi biwe mu bwato baramukurikira.<verse eid="MRK 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu yirukana impwemu mbi mu muntu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 1:21" />Nuko Yesu ajana na bo i Kaperinawumu. Umusi w’Isabato ushitse, yinjira mw’isinagogi arigisha. <verse eid="MRK 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 1:22" />Abamwumviriza batangazwa n’inyigisho ziwe, kuko yigishanya ububasha, mu buryo butandukanye n’ubw’abigisha b’ivyagezwe. <verse eid="MRK 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 1:23" />Ako kanya nyene, muri iyo sinagogi, umuntu yarimwo impwemu ihumanye, atangura gusemerera ati: <verse eid="MRK 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 1:24" />“Yesu w’i Nazareti, uturonderako iki? Uzanywe no kuduhonya? Ndazi uwo uri we. Uri Uwera w’Imana!”<verse eid="MRK 1:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 1:25" />Yesu arayizibiza ati: <char style="wj">“Hora! Muvemwo!”</char> <verse eid="MRK 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 1:26" />Ya mpwemu mbi ica iramujegeza hanyuma imuvamwo ivuza induru nyinshi.<verse eid="MRK 1:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 1:27" />Abantu bose baratangara, barabazanya bati: “Mbega ibi ni ibiki? Ni inyigisho nshasha kandi zirimwo ububasha! N’impwemu mbi na zo arazitegeka zikamwumvira!” <verse eid="MRK 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 1:28" />Maze inkuru ziwe zica zikwira mu ntara yose ya Galilaya.<verse eid="MRK 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu akiza abantu benshi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 1:29" />Bavuye mw’isinagogi, Yesu aca ajana na Yakobo na Yohana i muhira kwa Simoni na Andereya. <verse eid="MRK 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 1:30" />Bahashitse, baca babwira Yesu ko inabukwe wa Simoni ari ku buriri, agwaye kandi ashushe cane. <verse eid="MRK 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 1:31" />Nuko Yesu yegera aho ari, amufata ukuboko, aramuhagurutsa. Bwa bushuhe buca burahera, aca arabazimana.<verse eid="MRK 1:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 1:32" />Ku mugoroba izuba rimaze kurenga, bazanira Yesu abagwaye benshi n’ababoshwe n’abadayimoni. <verse eid="MRK 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 1:33" />Abantu bose bo muri ico gisagara bakoranira imbere y’umuryango yari arimwo. <verse eid="MRK 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 1:34" />Nuko Yesu akiza abantu benshi bari bagwaye ingwara zitandukanye. Yirukana n’impwemu mbi nyinshi, ntiyazemerera kugira ico zivuga kuko zari zamenye uwo ari we.<verse eid="MRK 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu avuga Ubutumwa Bwiza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 1:35" />Mu gitondo ca kare butaraca, Yesu aravyuka, arasohoka aja gusengera ahantu hiherereye. <verse eid="MRK 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 1:36" />Maze Simoni n’abari kumwe na we baja kumurondera. <verse eid="MRK 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 1:37" />Bamubonye baramubwira bati: “Abantu bose bariko barakurondera.”<verse eid="MRK 1:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 1:38" />Na we arabishura ati: <char style="wj">“Nimuze tuje mu yindi mihana yo hafi nje kwigishayo, kuko ari co canzanye.”</char> <verse eid="MRK 1:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 1:39" />Nuko agendagenda mu ntara yose ya Galilaya, avuga Ubutumwa Bwiza mu masinagogi, yirukana n’abadayimoni.<verse eid="MRK 1:39" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu ahumanura umuntu agwaye imibembe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 1:40" />Umuntu agwaye imibembe araza apfukama imbere yiwe, aramwinginga ati: “Ubishatse, woshobora kunkiza ngahumanuka.”<verse eid="MRK 1:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 1:41" />Yesu aterwa ikigongwe n’uwo muntu maze aramvura ukuboko amukorako, aramubwira ati: <char style="wj">“Ndabishatse, kira uhumanuke!”</char> <verse eid="MRK 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 1:42" />Ubwo nyene ya mibembe ica iramuvako arahumanuka.<verse eid="MRK 1:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 1:43" />Yesu aca aramurungika, aramwihanikiriza ati: <verse eid="MRK 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 1:44" /><char style="wj">“Ntihagire umuntu n’umwe ubibwira. Ariko genda ku muherezi agusuzume hanyuma utange ikimazi Mose yashinze ko uwuhumanutse atanga, kugira ngo bose bamenye ko wahumanutse.”</char> <verse eid="MRK 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 1:45" />Aho guhora, wa muntu aca aragenda atangura kuvuga no gukwiragiza iyo nkuru. Ivyo vyatumye Yesu adasubira kuja mu gisagara ku mugaragaro, ahubwo aca aguma inyuma yaco ahantu hihishije. Ariko na ho nyene abantu barahamusanga bavuye mu mihingo myinshi.<verse eid="MRK 1:45" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MRK 2" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu akiza umuntu akongataye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 2:1" />Haciye imisi, Yesu asubira i Kaperinawumu, maze inkuru iramenyekana ko yagarutse i muhira. <verse eid="MRK 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 2:2" />Abantu benshi bakoranira aho hantu haruzura ku buryo n’imbere y’umuryango ata kibanza cari kihasigaye. <verse eid="MRK 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 2:3" />Nuko haza abantu bane bateruye ku nderuzo umuntu akongataye. <verse eid="MRK 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 2:4" />Ariko kubera ubwinshi bw’abantu, ntivyakunda ko bashikira Yesu. Baca basambura ahantu hato ku nzu hejuru y’aho Yesu yari ari, bururukirizamwo ya nderuzo wa muntu aryamyeko. <verse eid="MRK 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 2:5" />Yesu abonye ukwizera kwabo, abwira uwo muntu amugaye ati: <char style="wj">“Mwana wanje, ivyaha vyawe urabihariwe.”</char><verse eid="MRK 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 2:6" />Bamwe mu bigisha b’ivyagezwe bari ngaho batangura kwibaza mu mitima yabo bati: <verse eid="MRK 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 2:7" />“Uwo mugabo yubahutse gute kuvuga gutyo? Ukwo ni ugutuka Imana! Ni nde ashobora guharira ivyaha atari Imana yonyene?”<verse eid="MRK 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 2:8" />Ubwo nyene Yesu amenya mu mpwemu yiwe ivyo bariko baribaza mu mitima yabo. Arababaza ati: <char style="wj">“Ni kuki muriko mwiyumvira gutyo mu mitima yanyu?</char> <verse eid="MRK 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 2:9" /><char style="wj">Mbega icoroshe ni uko nobwira uwu muntu amugaye nti: ‘Ivyaha vyawe urabihariwe,’ canke ni uko novuga nti: ‘Haguruka wikorere inderuzo yawe ugende’?</char> <verse eid="MRK 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 2:10" /><char style="wj">Ariko nshaka ko mutahura ko Umwana w’Umuntu afise ububasha kw’isi bwo guharira ivyaha.”</char> Nuko aca abwira uwo muntu ati: <verse eid="MRK 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 2:11" /><char style="wj">“Haguruka, ikorere inderuzo yawe, witahire.”</char> <verse eid="MRK 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 2:12" />Wa muntu aca arahaguruka, aterura inderuzo yiwe, asohoka bose babibona. Abantu bose baratangara, bahimbaza Imana bavuga bati: “Ntitwari bwabone ibintu nk’ibi!”<verse eid="MRK 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu ahamagara Lewi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 2:13" />Yesu yongera kuja ku nkengera y’ikiyaga c’i Galilaya. Nuko abantu benshi baza aho ari na we atangura kubigisha. <verse eid="MRK 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 2:14" />Ariko ararengana, abona Lewi mwene Alufayo yicaye aho yatoreza ikori, amubwira ati: <char style="wj">“Nkurikira!”</char> Lewi aca ava hasi, aramukurikira.<verse eid="MRK 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 2:15" />Maze Yesu acicaye mu nzu kwa Lewi ngo bamuzimane, haza abatozakori n’abanyavyaha benshi basangira na Yesu n’abigishwa biwe; kuko mu bakurikira Yesu harimwo benshi bameze nk’abo. <verse eid="MRK 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 2:16" />Bamwe mu bigisha b’ivyagezwe b’Abafarisayo babonye Yesu asangira n’abatozakori n’abandi banyavyaha, babaza abigishwa biwe bati: “Ni kuki asangira n’abatozakori n’abandi banyavyaha?”<verse eid="MRK 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 2:17" />Yesu avyumvise, abishura ati: <char style="wj">“Abakomeye si bo bakeneye umuganga, ahubwo abagwaye ni bo bamukeneye. Sinaje guhamagara abagororotsi, ahubwo naje guhamagara abanyavyaha.”</char><verse eid="MRK 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Babaza Yesu ivyerekeye kwisonzesha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 2:18" />Ikindi gihe, abigishwa ba Yohana n’Abafarisayo bari bisonzesheje. Maze abantu baza aho Yesu ari baramubaza bati: “Ni kuki abigishwa ba Yohana Umubatizi n’abigishwa b’Abafarisayo bisonzesha, ariko abigishwa bawe ntibisonzeshe?”<verse eid="MRK 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 2:19" />Yesu arabishura ati: <char style="wj">“Mbega abatumire b’umukwe bokwisonzesha bakiri kumwe na we mu musi mukuru? Ntibishoboka!</char> <verse eid="MRK 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 2:20" /><char style="wj">Ariko hazogera aho umukwe abakurwamwo; ico gihe bazoheza bisonzeshe.</char><verse eid="MRK 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 2:21" />
    <char style="wj">Nta wofata igitambara gishasha ngo akibaririre ku mpuzu y’umushire, kuko ico gitambara cotuma ya mpuzu y’umushire itabuka rwose.</char> <verse eid="MRK 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 2:22" /><char style="wj">Ni nk’uko ata wosuka umuvinyu mushasha mu mukuza w’urusato ushaje, kuko uwo muvinyu wotuma uwo mukuza umeneka; hanyuma wa muntu akabura umuvinyu n’umukuza. Ahubwo umuvinyu mushasha bawushira mu mukuza mushasha.”</char><verse eid="MRK 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Umwami w’Isabato</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 2:23" />Umusi umwe, ku musi w’Isabato, Yesu yariko aca mu mirima y’ingano ari kumwe n’abigishwa biwe. Bariko bararengana, abigishwa biwe bagenda baraca imitwe y’ingano zeze. <verse eid="MRK 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 2:24" />Abafarisayo baramubaza bati: “Ni kuki abigishwa bawe bakora ikizira ku musi w’Isabato?”<verse eid="MRK 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 2:25" />Yesu arabishura ati: <char style="wj">“Mbega ntimurasoma ivyo Dawidi yakoze igihe we n’abo bari kumwe bari bashonje, ata co kurya bafise?</char> <verse eid="MRK 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 2:26" /><char style="wj">Yinjiye mu nzu y’Imana, mu gihe c’umuherezi mukuru Abiyatari, arya imikate yashikaniwe Imana; kandi abaherezi ari bo bonyene bari bemerewe kuyirya; yongera ahako n’abari kumwe na we.”</char><verse eid="MRK 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 2:27" />Yesu aca arababwira ati: <char style="wj">“Isabato yashizweho ku neza y’umuntu, umuntu ntiyaremewe kuganzwa na yo,</char> <verse eid="MRK 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 2:28" /><char style="wj">ni co gituma Umwana w’Umuntu ari na we Mwami w’Isabato.”</char><verse eid="MRK 2:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MRK 3" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu akiza umuntu ku musi w’Isabato</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 3:1" />Ikindi gihe Yesu yinjira mw’isinagogi ahasanga umuntu akongataye ukuboko. <verse eid="MRK 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 3:2" />Bamwe mu bari aho bamuhanga amaso ngo barabe ko amukiza, kuko barondera ico bofatirako kugira ngo bamwagirize ko yakoze ku musi w’Isabato kandi kizira. <verse eid="MRK 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 3:3" />Yesu abwira wa muntu akongataye ukuboko ati: <char style="wj">“Haguruka uhagarare hano imbere y’aba bantu bose.”</char><verse eid="MRK 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 3:4" />Arababaza ati: <char style="wj">“Mbega icemewe gukorwa ku musi w’Isabato ni ikihe? Iciza canke ikibi? Gukiza umuntu canke kumwica?”</char> Ntihagira n’umwe amwishura.<verse eid="MRK 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 3:5" />Nuko Yesu abitegereza ashavuye, kandi ababajwe cane n’uko imitima yabo ikomantaye. Maze aca abwira uwo muntu ati: <char style="wj">“Gorora ukuboko kwawe.”</char> Akugoroye guca kurakira. <verse eid="MRK 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 3:6" />Abafarisayo baca baragenda baja inama n’abayoboke ba Herode, y’ingene bokwica Yesu.<verse eid="MRK 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abantu isinzi bakurikira Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 3:7" />Yesu n’abigishwa biwe bava aho hantu baja ku kiyaga, maze abantu isinzi baramukurikira bavuye i Galilaya, i Yudaya, <verse eid="MRK 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 3:8" />i Yerusalemu, muri Idumaya, hakurya y’uruzi Yorodani no mu micungararo y’intara za Tiro na Sidoni. Abo bose bamukurikiye kuko bumvise ibitangaza yakoze. <verse eid="MRK 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 3:9" />Nuko abwira abigishwa biwe ngo bamutegurire ubwato kugira ngo abantu ntibamugunde, <verse eid="MRK 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 3:10" />kuko yari yakijije abantu benshi bituma abagwaye bandi barondera kumukorako. <verse eid="MRK 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 3:11" />Abantu baboshwe n’impwemu mbi bamukubise ijisho, izo mpwemu mbi zaca zibakubita hasi zigasemerera ziti: “Uri Umwana w’Imana!” <verse eid="MRK 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 3:12" />Ariko we yaca azikankamira ngo zihore, ntizisubire kuvuga uwo ari we.<verse eid="MRK 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu atoranya abigishwa cumi na babiri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 3:13" />Hanyuma Yesu aduga ku musozi ahamagara abo agomvye, na bo baza aho ari. <verse eid="MRK 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 3:14" />Maze atoranyamwo cumi na babiri, abita intumwa, kugira ngo babane na we yongere abatume kuvuga Ubutumwa Bwiza; <verse eid="MRK 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 3:15" />abaha n’ububasha bwo kwirukana abadayimoni.<verse eid="MRK 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="lh">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 3:16" />Aya ni yo mazina y’abo cumi na babiri yatoranije:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="MRK 3:16" />
  <para style="li1" vid="MRK 3:16">Simoni (uwo yise Petero);<verse eid="MRK 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 3:17" />Yakobo na Yohana bene Zebedayo (na bo abita Bowanerige, bisigura “abana b’inkuba”),<verse eid="MRK 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 3:18" />Andereya,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MRK 3:18">Filipo,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MRK 3:18">Baruteremi,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MRK 3:18">Matayo,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MRK 3:18">Toma,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MRK 3:18">Yakobo mwene Alufayo,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MRK 3:18">Tadeyo,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MRK 3:18">Simoni Umuzelote,<verse eid="MRK 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 3:19" />na Yuda Isikariyote, ari we yahavuye amugurisha.<verse eid="MRK 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bitirira Satani ibikorwa vya Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 3:20" />Hanyuma Yesu aja i muhira, maze abantu benshi basubira gukoranira aho ari, ku buryo we n’abigishwa biwe bitashoboka ko bafungura. <verse eid="MRK 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 3:21" />Abo mu muryango wiwe bavyumvise, baja kumufata, kuko bavuga bati: “Yasaze.”<verse eid="MRK 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 3:22" />Abigisha b’ivyagezwe bari baje bava i Yerusalemu bavuga bati: “Akoreshwa n’ububasha bwa Beyelizebuli! Umukuru w’abadayimoni ni we amushoboza kwirukana abadayimoni.”<verse eid="MRK 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 3:23" />Yesu arabahamagara ababwira mu migani ati: <char style="wj">“Mbega Satani yokwirukana Satani gute?</char> <verse eid="MRK 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 3:24" /><char style="wj">Iyo ubwami bwiciyemwo ibice, buba bugiye gusenyuka.</char> <verse eid="MRK 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 3:25" /><char style="wj">Kandi iyo umuryango wiciyemwo ibice, ntushobora kurama.</char> <verse eid="MRK 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 3:26" /><char style="wj">Iyo Satani yigwanije akicamwo ibice, ntashobora guhagarara, ivyiwe biba biheze.</char> <verse eid="MRK 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 3:27" /><char style="wj">Nta muntu yokwinjira mu nzu y’umunyenkomezi ngo amunyage ivyo atunze atabanje kumuboha. Aho ni ho honyene ashobora kwinjira mu nzu akamunyaga ivyiwe.</char> <verse eid="MRK 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 3:28" /><char style="wj">Ndababwire ukuri, ivyaha vyose abana b’abantu bakora n’ibitutsi vyose batuka Imana barashobora kubibabarirwa.</char> <verse eid="MRK 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 3:29" /><char style="wj">Ariko umuntu wese atuka Mpwemu Yera ntazokwigera abiharirwa, icaha ciwe kizohoraho ibihe bidashira.”</char><verse eid="MRK 3:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 3:30" />Ivyo yabivuze kuko bariko bavuga ngo arimwo impwemu mbi.<verse eid="MRK 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nyina na bene nyina ba Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 3:31" />Nyina wa Yesu na bene nyina baraza bahagarara hanze, batuma umuntu kumuhamagara. <verse eid="MRK 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 3:32" />Abantu bari bamukikije baramubwira bati: “Nyoko na bene nyoko bari hanze kandi barakurondera.”<verse eid="MRK 3:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 3:33" />Arababaza ati: <char style="wj">“Mama ni nde kandi bene mama ni ba nde?”</char><verse eid="MRK 3:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 3:34" />Nuko yihweza abari bamukikije, avuga ati: <char style="wj">“Aba ni bo mama kandi ni bo bene mama.</char> <verse eid="MRK 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 3:35" /><char style="wj">Uwukora ivyo Imana ishaka wese ni we mwene mama kandi ni we mama.”</char><verse eid="MRK 3:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MRK 4" />
  <para style="s1">Umugani w’umubivyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 4:1" />Ikindi gihe Yesu asubira kwigishiriza ku nkengera y’ikiyaga c’i Galilaya, maze abantu isinzi bakoranira aho ari, na we aca atambukira mu bwato abwicaramwo, abantu na bo bahagarara i musozi. <verse eid="MRK 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 4:2" />Nuko abigisha vyinshi mu migani, ababwira ati: <verse eid="MRK 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 4:3" /><char style="wj">“Umviriza! Habaye umurimyi yasohoye imbuto ziwe aja kubiba.</char> <verse eid="MRK 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 4:4" /><char style="wj">Ariko arabiba, zimwe zigwa i ruhande y’inzira, hanyuma inyoni ziraza zirazinobagura.</char> <verse eid="MRK 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 4:5" /><char style="wj">Izindi zigwa ku rutare, ahantu hatagira ivu ryinshi; zica zimera ningoga kuko ivu ryari rike.</char> <verse eid="MRK 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 4:6" /><char style="wj">Ariko izuba ryatse, za mbuto zica ziruma kuko imizi yazo itashika kure.</char> <verse eid="MRK 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 4:7" /><char style="wj">Izindi mbuto zigwa mu mahwa; zimaze kumera, ayo mahwa arakura arazinyoha, ntizashobora kwama.</char> <verse eid="MRK 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 4:8" /><char style="wj">Ariko hari n’imbuto zaguye mw’ivu ryiza. Izo zarameze, zirakura kandi zirama; zimwe zama mirongo itatu, izindi mirongo itandatu, izindi ijana.”</char><verse eid="MRK 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 4:9" />Hanyuma aca ababwira ati: <char style="wj">“Uwufise amatwi yumva, niyumve!”</char><verse eid="MRK 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 4:10" />Inyuma y’aho, Yesu ari kumwe na bamwe cumi na babiri n’abandi bari bamukikije, bamubaza ivyerekeye iyo migani. <verse eid="MRK 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 4:11" />Arabishura ati: <char style="wj">“Mwebwe mwahawe kumenya amabanga y’ivy’Ubwami bw’Imana. Ariko ku bandi bo hanze, nkoresha imigani</char> <verse eid="MRK 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 4:12" /><char style="wj">kugira ngo,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 4:12">
    <char style="wj">‘naho boraba, ntibabone,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 4:12">
    <char style="wj">naho bokwumviriza ntibatahure;</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 4:12">
    <char style="wj">kugira ngo ntibagaruke ku Mana na yo ngo ibababarire.’</char>
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">4:12 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">
        <char style="xt">
          <ref loc="ISA 6:9">Yesaya 6:9</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 6:10">10</ref></char>
      </char>
    </note>
    <char style="wj">”</char><verse eid="MRK 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 4:13" />Nuko Yesu arababaza ati: <char style="wj">“Mbega ntimutahura uwo mugani? None iyindi mwoyitahura gute?</char> <verse eid="MRK 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 4:14" /><char style="wj">Umubivyi abiba ijambo ry’Imana.</char> <verse eid="MRK 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 4:15" /><char style="wj">Abantu bamwe bafise imitima imeze nk’i ruhande y’inzira. Bagiheza kwumva iryo jambo, Satani araza agakura iryo jambo ritewe mu mitima yabo.</char> <verse eid="MRK 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 4:16" /><char style="wj">Abandi, imitima yabo imeze nk’urutare. Abo ni abumva ijambo ry’Imana bakaryakirana umunezero.</char> <verse eid="MRK 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 4:17" /><char style="wj">Ariko kubera iryo jambo ritagira imizi muri bo, bamara akanya gato bizeye. Iyo baciye mu vyago canke mu guhamwa kubw’iryo jambo ry’Imana, baca bata ukwizera.</char> <verse eid="MRK 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 4:18" /><char style="wj">Abandi bafise imitima imeze nk’umurima urimwo amahwa. Abo barumva ijambo ry’Imana,</char> <verse eid="MRK 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 4:19" /><char style="wj">ariko imyitwarariko y’ivy’iyi si, n’uruhendo rw’ubutunzi n’ibindi vyipfuzo vy’uburyo bwinshi, biraza bikanyoha iryo jambo bigatuma ata co ryama.</char> <verse eid="MRK 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 4:20" /><char style="wj">Abandi imitima yabo imeze nk’umurima ufise ivu ryiza. Abo na bo ni abumva ijambo ry’Imana bakaryakira maze bakama ivyamwa, bamwe mirongo itatu, abandi mirongo itandatu, abandi ijana.”</char><verse eid="MRK 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Umugani w’itara</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 4:21" />Yesu yongera kubabwira ati: <char style="wj">“Mbega hari umuntu yodomeka itara akaryubikako igiseke canke akarishira musi y’igitanda? Mbega ntibarishira aho risanzwe riterekwa?</char> <verse eid="MRK 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 4:22" /><char style="wj">Nta canyegejwe kitazoshirwa ahabona, kandi nta cagizwe ibanga kitazomenyekana.</char> <verse eid="MRK 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 4:23" /><char style="wj">Uwufise amatwi yumva, niyumve!”</char><verse eid="MRK 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 4:24" />Yongera kubabwira ati: <char style="wj">“Mubanze mwitondere cane ivyo mwumva! Kuko uko mugerera abandi ari ko namwe muzogererwa, mbere birushirije.</char> <verse eid="MRK 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 4:25" /><char style="wj">Uwufise azokwongererezwa, uwudafise azokwakwa n’ivyo yari afise.”</char><verse eid="MRK 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Umugani w’imbuto ibibwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 4:26" />Yesu yongera kubabwira ati: <char style="wj">“Uku ni ko Ubwami bw’Imana bugereranywa: Iyo umuntu abivye imbuto mu murima wiwe,</char> <verse eid="MRK 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 4:27" /><char style="wj">haba mw’ijoro canke ku murango, asinziriye canke ari maso, izo mbuto ziramera, zigakura, ariko we ntamenya uko bigenda.</char> <verse eid="MRK 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 4:28" /><char style="wj">Isi ubwayo ni yo ituma icabibwe gikura kandi kikama: ubwa mbere haza umutumba waco, hagakurikira umuyange, hanyuma intete.</char> <verse eid="MRK 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 4:29" /><char style="wj">Umurima weze, wa murimyi arazana umuhoro akimbura, kuko iyimbura riba rigeze.”</char><verse eid="MRK 4:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Umugani w’akabuto gato</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 4:30" />Yesu yongera kuvuga ati: <char style="wj">“Mbega Ubwami bw’Imana twobugereranya n’iki? Twokoresha uwuhe mugani mu kubusigura?</char> <verse eid="MRK 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 4:31" /><char style="wj">Ubwami bw’Imana busa n’akabuto k’igiterwa citwa mutaride. Ako kabuto ni gato kurusha izindi zose zo kw’isi.</char> <verse eid="MRK 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 4:32" /><char style="wj">Ariko iyo gatewe, karakura kakaba igiti kiruta ibindi vyose. Amashami yaco arakura, akaba manini kugeza n’aho inyoni ziza zikarika mu gitutu caco.”</char><verse eid="MRK 4:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 4:33" />Yesu yigisha abantu akoresheje imigani myinshi isa n’iyo, akurikije ivyo bashobora gutahura. <verse eid="MRK 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 4:34" />Nta kintu na kimwe yabigishije adakoresheje imigani. Ariko asigaranye n’abigishwa biwe bonyene, yaca abasigurira vyose.<verse eid="MRK 4:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu ahagarika igihuhusi mu kiyaga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 4:35" />Ku mugoroba w’uwo musi nyene, Yesu abwira abigishwa biwe ati: <char style="wj">“Tujabuke tuje hakurya y’ikiyaga.”</char> <verse eid="MRK 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 4:36" />Nuko basiga aho rya sinzi ry’abantu, baja mu bwato Yesu yari yicayemwo, bajana na we. Kandi hari n’ubundi bwato bwajanye n’ubwabo. <verse eid="MRK 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 4:37" />Maze haza umuyaga w’igihuhusi ukomeye bituma imipfunda y’amazi yisuka mu bwato, ku buryo bwari bugiye kwuzura amazi. <verse eid="MRK 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 4:38" />Yesu we yari aryamye inyuma mu bwato, yiseguye yisinziririye. Abigishwa baramukangura, bamubwira bati: “Mwigisha, nta co bikubwiye ko tugira twicwe n’amazi?”<verse eid="MRK 4:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 4:39" />Nuko Yesu aravyuka, akankamira uwo muyaga, abwira ikiyaga ati: <char style="wj">“Hora, tekereza!”</char> Wa muyaga uca urahagarara, haba agahwekere.<verse eid="MRK 4:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 4:40" />Aca abwira abigishwa biwe ati: “Ni kuki mufise ubwoba? Mbega n’ubu nta kwizera mugira?”<verse eid="MRK 4:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 4:41" />Ba bigishwa baratinya cane, barabazanya bati: “Mbega uwu ni umuntu ki, ko umuyaga n’imipfunda na vyo bimwumvira?”<verse eid="MRK 4:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MRK 5" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu akiza umuntu arimwo impwemu mbi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 5:1" />Nuko bashika hakurya y’ikiyaga c’i Galilaya, mu ntara ya Gerasene. <verse eid="MRK 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 5:2" />Yesu avuye mu bwato, umuntu arimwo impwemu mbi aza guhura na we avuye mu mva. <verse eid="MRK 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 5:3" />Uwo muntu yaba mw’itongo ry’abapfuye kandi nta muntu yashobora kumuboha, naho yokoresheje iminyororo. <verse eid="MRK 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 5:4" />Kuko kenshi bamubohesha iminyororo ku maboko n’ivyuma ku maguru, ariko iyo minyororo yarayicagagura, n’ivyo vyuma akabivunagura. Nta muntu n’umwe yashobora kumutururuza. <verse eid="MRK 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 5:5" />Uko bukeye, uko bwije, yagendagenda mu mva no ku misozi aboroga kandi yikomeretsa n’amabuye akarishe.<verse eid="MRK 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 5:6" />Uwo muntu abonye Yesu akiri kure, ariruka apfukama imbere yiwe. <verse eid="MRK 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 5:7" />Arasemerera n’ijwi rirenga ati: “Mbega undonderako iki ga Yesu, Mwana w’Imana Musumbavyose? Ndakwinginze mw’izina ry’Imana ntunkubagure!” <verse eid="MRK 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 5:8" />Ivyo yabivuze kuko Yesu yari ahejeje kuyibwira ati: <char style="wj">“Wa mpwemu mbi we, muvemwo!”</char><verse eid="MRK 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 5:9" />Yesu arayibaza ati: <char style="wj">“Witwa nde?”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 5:9">Na yo iramwishura iti: “Nitwa Gitero, kuko turi benshi.” <verse eid="MRK 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 5:10" />Nuko za mpwemu mbi zinginga Yesu zishimitse ngo ntazirukane muri iyo ntara.<verse eid="MRK 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 5:11" />Hafi y’aho, hari umukuku w’ingurube zari ziragiwe ku musozi. <verse eid="MRK 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 5:12" />Abo badayimoni binginga Yesu bati: “Twemerere uturungike muri ziriya ngurube, tuzinjiremwo.” <verse eid="MRK 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 5:13" />Nuko Yesu arazemerera. Izo mpwemu mbi ziva muri wa muntu zinjira muri za ngurube. Izo ngurube zashika nk’ibihumbi bibiri. Nuko ziva kuri wa musozi ziruka zimanuka zisuka mu kiyaga ziradwibira, zicwa n’amazi.<verse eid="MRK 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 5:14" />Abari baziragiye baca barahunga, baja kubivuga mu gisagara co hafi y’aho no mu misozi ihegereye. Nuko abantu barakorana baza kuraba ivyabaye. <verse eid="MRK 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 5:15" />Bashitse aho Yesu ari, babona wa muntu yari yaraboshwe n’abadayimoni benshi yicaye, yambaye kandi afise ubwenge bukwiye, maze bagira ubwoba. <verse eid="MRK 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 5:16" />Ababonye uko vyagenze baca babiganira ivyabaye kuri wa muntu yari aboshwe n’abadayimoni no kuri za ngurube. <verse eid="MRK 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 5:17" />Maze abo bantu binginga Yesu ngo abavire mu ntara.<verse eid="MRK 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 5:18" />Yesu ariko arurira mu bwato, wa muntu yari yaraboshwe n’abadayimoni aramwinginga ngo bajane. <verse eid="MRK 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 5:19" />Ariko Yesu ntiyamwemerera, ahubwo amubwira ati: <char style="wj">“Subira i muhira mu muryango wawe, ubabwire ivyo Umwami Imana yagukoreye vyose, n’ingene yakugiriye imbabazi.”</char> <verse eid="MRK 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 5:20" />Wa muntu aca arataha ageze i Dekapolisi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Akarere kagizwe n’ibisagara cumi.</char></note>, atangura kuvuga ivyo Yesu yamukoreye. Abantu bose bavyumvise baratangara cane.<verse eid="MRK 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu azura umwana, akiza n’umugore agwaye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 5:21" />Yesu amaze kujabuka agasubira hakurya y’ikiyaga, abantu isinzi baraza bakoranira hafi y’ikiyaga aho yari ari. <verse eid="MRK 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 5:22" />Maze haza umwe mu bakuru b’isinagogi, yitwa Yayiro. Abonye Yesu, apfukama imbere yiwe, <verse eid="MRK 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 5:23" />aramutakambira ati: “Umukobwa wanje ari ku mpfiro. Ndakwinginze uze umurambikeko ibiganza akire abe muzima.” <verse eid="MRK 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 5:24" />Nuko Yesu ajana na we.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 5:24">Kandi hari abantu benshi bari bamukurikiye, bamubanda. <verse eid="MRK 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 5:25" />Muri bo harimwo n’umugore yari amaze imyaka cumi n’ibiri agwaye ingwara yo mu gitereko yo kuva amaraso<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yava amaraso mu gihimba ciwe c’irondoka.</char></note>. <verse eid="MRK 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 5:26" />Yari yarivuje ku baganga benshi kandi atanga ivyo yari afise vyose, ariko aho gukira abandanya aremba. <verse eid="MRK 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 5:27" />Yumvise inkuru za Yesu, araza amuturuka inyuma, aca muri rya sinzi ry’abantu, akora ku mpuzu yiwe, <verse eid="MRK 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 5:28" />kuko yibwira ati: “Naho nokora ku mpuzu yiwe gusa, nokira.” <verse eid="MRK 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 5:29" />Ubwo nyene kwa kuva amaraso kurahagarara, yumva mu mubiri wiwe ko akize ingwara yiwe.<verse eid="MRK 5:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 5:30" />Ako kanya nyene Yesu yumva ko hari ubushobozi bumuvuyemwo. Ahindukirira rya sinzi ry’abantu, arababaza ati: <char style="wj">“Ni nde akoze ku mpuzu zanje?”</char><verse eid="MRK 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 5:31" />Abigishwa biwe baramwishura bati: “Abantu bariko barakubanda impande zose, none uriko ubaza ngo: <char style="wj">‘Ni nde ankozeko?’</char> ”<verse eid="MRK 5:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 5:32" />Ariko Yesu abandanya araba hirya no hino kugira ngo arabe ko yobona uwamukozeko. <verse eid="MRK 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 5:33" />Wa mugore, kuko yari azi ivyamubayeko, aza ajugumira kubera ubwoba, apfukama imbere y’ibirenge vya Yesu, amubwira ukuri kwose. <verse eid="MRK 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 5:34" />Yesu aramubwira ati: <char style="wj">“Mwana wanje, ukwizera kwawe kuragukijije, igire amahoro kandi ukire icago cawe.”</char><verse eid="MRK 5:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 5:35" />Yesu akiriko aravuga, haza abantu bavuye kwa Yayiro, wa mukuru w’isinagogi, bamubwira bati: “Umukobwa wawe yamaze gucikana. Ni kuki ubandanya ugora umwigisha?”<verse eid="MRK 5:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 5:36" />Yesu yumvise ivyo bavuze, aca abwira Yayiro ati: <char style="wj">“Ntutinye, wizere gusa.”</char><verse eid="MRK 5:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 5:37" />Ntiyemerera umuntu n’umwe kumukurikira kiretse Petero, Yakobo na Yohana mwene nyina wa Yakobo. <verse eid="MRK 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 5:38" />Bashitse i muhira kwa wa mukuru w’isinagogi, Yesu ahasanga urwamo rwinshi, abantu barira, abandi na bo bakoma induru n’ijwi rirenga. <verse eid="MRK 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 5:39" />Nuko arinjira, ababwira ati: <char style="wj">“Ni kuki hari induru n’amarira? Umwana ntiyapfuye, arasinziriye.”</char> <verse eid="MRK 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 5:40" />Ba bantu baramutwenga.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 5:40">Amaze kubasohora bose, yinjirana na se na nyina b’umwana hamwe na ba bigishwa bari kumwe na we, baja aho umwana ari. <verse eid="MRK 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 5:41" />Amufata ukuboko amubwira ati: <char style="tl"><char style="wj">“Talita kumi!”</char></char> bisigura ngo: <char style="wj">“Gakobwa, ndakubwiye nti vyuka!”</char> <verse eid="MRK 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 5:42" />Ako kanya wa mukobwa arahaguruka atangura kugendagenda; yari afise nk’imyaka cumi n’ibiri. Babonye ibibaye, bose baratangara cane. <verse eid="MRK 5:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 5:43" />Maze Yesu arabihanikiriza ngo ntihagire umuntu n’umwe babwira ivyabaye, yongera ababwira ngo bagaburire uwo mwana.<verse eid="MRK 5:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MRK 6" />
  <para style="s1">Ab’i Nazareti banka kwizera Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 6:1" />Nuko Yesu ava ngaho aja i Nazareti, igisagara yakuriyemwo, ajanye n’abigishwa biwe. <verse eid="MRK 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 6:2" />Umusi w’Isabato ushitse, atangura kwigisha mw’isinagogi; benshi bamwumvirije baratangara cane.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:2">Barabazanya bati: “Mbega ivyo yigisha yabikuye he? Ubwo bwenge n’ubwo bushobozi bwo gukora ibitangaza yabikuye he? <verse eid="MRK 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 6:3" />Mbega uwu si wa mubaji? Nyina si Mariya, abo bavukana si Yakobo, Yosefu, Yuda na Simoni? Bashiki biwe si ababanyi bacu?” Maze ivyo birabatsitaza, bituma batamwizera.<verse eid="MRK 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 6:4" />Yesu arababwira ati: <char style="wj">“Uwuvugishwa n’Imana arubahwa hose kiretse iwabo no mu muryango wiwe.”</char> <verse eid="MRK 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 6:5" />Nta gitangaza yahakoreye kiretse abantu bake yarambitseko ibiganza, akabasengera bagakira. <verse eid="MRK 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 6:6" />Maze atangazwa cane n’ukutizera kwabo.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="MRK 6:6">Yesu arungika abigishwa biwe cumi na babiri</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:6">Nuko Yesu agendagenda yigisha, ava mu mihana aja mu yindi. <verse eid="MRK 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 6:7" />Ahamagara bamwe cumi na babiri, abarungika ari babiribabiri, abaha ububasha bwo kwirukana impwemu zihumanye.<verse eid="MRK 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 6:8" />Ababwira abihanikiriza ati: <char style="wj">“Ntihagire ikintu na kimwe mujana ku rugendo kiretse inkoni yo kwishimikiza. Ntimujane ivyokurya, amasakoshi, canke amahera mu mifuko yanyu.</char> <verse eid="MRK 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 6:9" /><char style="wj">Mwambare ibirato kandi ntihagire impuzu zo gukuranya mutwara.</char> <verse eid="MRK 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 6:10" /><char style="wj">Inzu muzokwinjiramwo bakabakira, muze muyigumemwo kugeza muvuye aho hantu.</char> <verse eid="MRK 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 6:11" /><char style="wj">Nimwaja ahantu bakanka kubakira canke kubumviriza, muze mukunkumure umukungugu wo mu birenge vyanyu, muhave. Ico kizobabera ikimenyetso co kubagiriza.”</char><verse eid="MRK 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 6:12" />Nuko baragenda bigisha abantu ivyo kwihana; <verse eid="MRK 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 6:13" />birukana abadayimoni benshi kandi basiga amavuta abagwaye benshi, barabasengera barakira.<verse eid="MRK 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Herode azazanirwa n’ivya Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 6:14" />Muri iyo misi, Umwami Herode Antipa yumva inkuru za Yesu kuko yari yamaze kumenyekana cane. Bamwe bavuga bati: “Yohana Umubatizi yazutse, ni co gituma afise ubushobozi bwo gukora ibitangaza.”<verse eid="MRK 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 6:15" />Abandi bavuga bati: “Ni Eliya.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:15">Hakaba n’abandi bavuga bati: “Ni uwuvugishwa n’Imana, asa n’umwe mu bavugishwa n’Imana ba kera.”<verse eid="MRK 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 6:16" />Ariko Herode avyumvise aravuga ati: “Ko Yohana ari jewe namuciye umutwe, yoba yazutse!”<verse eid="MRK 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 6:17" />Herode Antipa ubwiwe ni we yari yatanze itegeko ryo gufata Yohana, kumuboha no kumuta mw’ibohero. Ivyo yabikoze abitumwe na Herodiya, uwo yari yararongoye kandi yari asanzwe ari muka Filipo, uwo bavukana. <verse eid="MRK 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 6:18" />Kuko Yohana yama abwira Herode ati: “Ntivyemewe ko urongora umugore w’uwo muvukana.” <verse eid="MRK 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 6:19" />Ivyo vyatumye Herodiya amwanka urwanko rubi, akipfuza kumwica. Ariko ntiyabishobora, <verse eid="MRK 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 6:20" />kuko Herode yatinya Yohana akamukingira. Yari amuzi nk’umuntu w’umugororotsi kandi w’intungane. Igihe cose yamwumviriza, ivyiwe vyaramubuza amahoro, ariko kandi agakunda kumwumviriza.<verse eid="MRK 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 6:21" />Maze igihe kimwe Herodiya aronka akaryo. Ku musi mukuru wo kwibuka ivuka rya Herode, umwami yateguye umusi mukuru atumira abategetsi bakurubakuru bo ku ngoma yiwe, intwazangabo hamwe n’abatware bo mu ntara ya Galilaya. <verse eid="MRK 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 6:22" />Maze umukobwa wa Herodiya araza aratamba, anezereza cane Herode n’abatumire biwe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:22">Umwami aca abwira uwo mukobwa ati: “Nsaba ico ushaka cose, ndakiguha.” <verse eid="MRK 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 6:23" />Ivyo yabimwemereye ashizeko n’indahiro ati: “Ico unsaba cose ndakiguha, naho coba igice c’ubwami bwanje.”<verse eid="MRK 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 6:24" />Wa mukobwa arasohoka abaza nyina ati: “Nsabe iki?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:24">Na we aramwishura ati: “Saba umutwe wa Yohana Umubatizi!”<verse eid="MRK 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 6:25" />Ubwo nyene wa mukobwa ariruka asubira aho umwami ari, aramubwira ati: “Nsavye ko umpa ubu nyene umutwe wa Yohana Umubatizi kw’isiniya!”<verse eid="MRK 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 6:26" />Maze umwami Herode arababara cane, ariko kubera indahiro yarahiye imbere y’abatumire, ntiyashobora kumwankira ico asavye. <verse eid="MRK 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 6:27" />Nuko aca arungika umusoda amutegeka kuzana umutwe wa Yohana. Wa musoda aja mw’ibohero, aca umutwe Yohana, <verse eid="MRK 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 6:28" />agaruka awuzanye kw’isiniya, awuha wa mukobwa na we awuha nyina. <verse eid="MRK 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 6:29" />Abigishwa ba Yohana bavyumvise baraza batora ikiziga ciwe baja kugihamba.<verse eid="MRK 6:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu agaburira abantu ibihumbi bitanu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 6:30" />Intumwa zigarutse zikoranira aho Yesu ari, zimwiganira ivyo zakoze n’ivyo zigishije. <verse eid="MRK 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 6:31" />Kubera hari uruja n’uruza rw’abantu benshi ku buryo batashobora no kuronka akaryo ko gufungura, Yesu aca ababwira ati: <char style="wj">“Nimuze tuje mu kibanza gitekanye, turuhuke.”</char><verse eid="MRK 6:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 6:32" />Nuko bafata ubwato baja ahantu hiherereye. <verse eid="MRK 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 6:33" />Ariko benshi bababona bakiva aho hantu, barabamenya, baca bava mu bisagara vyose bariruka n’amaguru, babatangayo. <verse eid="MRK 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 6:34" />Yesu amaze kuva mu bwato abona abantu benshi, bamutera akagongwe, kuko bari bameze nk’intama zitagira umwungere. Nuko atangura kubigisha vyinshi.<verse eid="MRK 6:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 6:35" />Bumaze kwira, abigishwa biwe baza aho ari, bamubwira bati: “Aha hantu turi ni mu gahinga kandi buriko burira. <verse eid="MRK 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 6:36" />Rungika aba bantu baje mu misozi no mu mihana yo hafi kugira ngo bigurire ivyo barya.”<verse eid="MRK 6:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 6:37" />Yesu arabishura ati: <char style="wj">“Nimubagaburire mwebwe nyene.”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:37">Na bo baramubwira bati: “Mbega twokura hehe idenariyo amajana abiri zo kugura ivyokurya bikwiye aba bantu?”<verse eid="MRK 6:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 6:38" />Yesu arababaza ati: <char style="wj">“Mufise imikate ingahe? Genda murabe.”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:38">Bagarutse bamubwira bati: “Dufise imikate itanu n’ifi zibiri.”<verse eid="MRK 6:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 6:39" />Nuko abatuma kwicarika abantu mu migwi ahantu hari ubwatsi butotahaye. <verse eid="MRK 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 6:40" />Bicara mu migwi y’abantu ijanijana na mirongo itanu itanu. <verse eid="MRK 6:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 6:41" />Yesu afata ya mikate itanu na za fi zibiri, araba mw’ijuru, abishimira Imana. Hanyuma amanyagura ya mikate, ayihereza abigishwa ngo bayigaburire abantu. Abagaburira na za fi bose uko bangana. <verse eid="MRK 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 6:42" />Nuko bose bararya kandi barahaga. <verse eid="MRK 6:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 6:43" />Hanyuma abigishwa begeranya ibiseke cumi na bibiri vy’ivyasigaye kuri ya mikate na za fi. <verse eid="MRK 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 6:44" />Abariye bari abagabo ibihumbi bitanu.<verse eid="MRK 6:44" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu agendera hejuru ku mazi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 6:45" />Hanyuma y’ivyo, Yesu abwira abigishwa biwe ngo baje mu bwato babe baragenda bamwitangire imbere mu kujabuka i Betesayida; na we asigare arasezera abantu. <verse eid="MRK 6:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 6:46" />Ahejeje kubasezera, aca aduga umusozi gusenga.<verse eid="MRK 6:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 6:47" />Bumaze kwira, bwa bwato bwari bugeze hagati mu kiyaga, Yesu we yari akiri ku musozi ari wenyene. <verse eid="MRK 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 6:48" />Akiri ngaho, abona ko abigishwa biwe bafise ingorane nyinshi mu gusoza kuko umuyaga waza ubaturutse imbere. Ijoro rigeze kure bugiye guca, aza aho bari, agendera ku mazi, asa n’uwugira abarengane. <verse eid="MRK 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 6:49" />Bamubonye agendera ku mazi, bagira ngo ni umuzimu, baca bakoma induru, <verse eid="MRK 6:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 6:50" />kuko bose bari bagize ubwoba bwinshi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:50">Aca arababwira ati: <char style="wj">“Humura! Ni jewe. Ntimugire ubwoba.”</char> <verse eid="MRK 6:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 6:51" />Nuko atambukira mu bwato maze umuyaga uca urahagarara. Na bo baratangara cane, <verse eid="MRK 6:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 6:52" />kuko na ca gitangaza c’imikate batari bwagitahure, bitumwe n’uko imitima yabo yari ikomantajwe n’ukutizera.<verse eid="MRK 6:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 6:53" />Bamaze kujabuka, bashika hakurya ahitwa Genezareti, bazirikira ubwato i musozi. <verse eid="MRK 6:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 6:54" />Bururutse ubwato, abantu barababona, bamenyamwo Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 6:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 6:55" />Baca bakwiragira muri ako karere kose bazana abantu bagwaye ku nderuzo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:55 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Igikoresho kimeze nk’uburiri batwarako umurwayi.</char></note>, babajana aho bumvise ko Yesu ari hose. <verse eid="MRK 6:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 6:56" />Kandi aho yaja hose, haba mu mihana, mu bisagara canke mu misozi, abantu bazana abagwaye babo bakabashira ahabona, maze bakamwinginga ngo abareke bakore ku musozo w’impuzu yiwe, kandi abawukorako bose baca bakira.<verse eid="MRK 6:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MRK 7" />
  <para style="s1">Ibihumanya n’ibidahumanya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 7:1" />Abafarisayo na bamwe mu bigisha b’ivyagezwe bari bavuye i Yerusalemu baragenda bakoranira aho Yesu ari, <verse eid="MRK 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 7:2" />maze babona bamwe mu bigishwa biwe bafungura kandi amaboko yabo ahumanye, ni ukuvuga batakaravye nk’uko umugenzo wabitegeka. <verse eid="MRK 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 7:3" />Mu bisanzwe, Abafarisayo n’abandi Bayuda ntibashobora gufungura batabanje gukaraba nk’uko umugenzo wa ba sekuru wabitegeka. <verse eid="MRK 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 7:4" />Kandi n’iyo bavuye kw’isoko, ntibashobora gufungura batabanje gukaraba. Barakurikiza n’iyindi migenzo, nko kwoza ibikombe, amasafuriya, amasahani n’imeza.<verse eid="MRK 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 7:5" />Nuko ba Bafarisayo na ba bigisha b’ivyagezwe babaza Yesu bati: “Ni kuki abigishwa bawe batubahiriza imigenzo ya ba sogokuruza, bagafungura n’iminwe ihumanye?”<verse eid="MRK 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 7:6" />Arabishura ati: “Yesaya yavuze ukuri igihe yabavugishwako mwa ndyarya mwe! Yanditse avuga ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 7:6">
    <char style="wj">‘Aba bantu banyubahisha iminwa yabo,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 7:6">
    <char style="wj">ariko imitima yabo iri kure yanje.</char><verse eid="MRK 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 7:7" />
    <char style="wj">Ukunsenga kwabo ntikugira ikimazi;</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 7:7">
    <char style="wj">inyigisho zabo ni amabwirizwa abantu bishingiye.’</char>
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">7:7 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">
        <char style="xt">
          <ref loc="ISA 29:13">Yesaya 29:13</ref>
        </char>
      </char>
    </note><verse eid="MRK 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 7:8" />
    <char style="wj">Mureka amabwirizwa y’Imana mugashira imitima ku migenzo y’abantu.”</char><verse eid="MRK 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 7:9" />Yongera arababwira ati: <char style="wj">“Mwagize ishaka ryo kutubahiriza amabwirizwa y’Imana kugira ngo mwubahirize imigenzo yanyu!</char> <verse eid="MRK 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 7:10" /><char style="wj">Kuko Mose yavuze ati: ‘Wubahe so na nyoko,’</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 20:12">Kuvayo 20:12</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:16">Gusubiramwo 5:16</ref></char></char></note> <char style="wj">yongerako ati: ‘Umuntu wese azovuma se canke nyina, aze yicwe.’</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 21:17">Kuvayo 21:17</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 20:9">Abalewi 20:9</ref></char></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 7:11" /><char style="wj">Ariko mweho muvuga ko iyo umuntu afise ico yari gufashisha se canke nyina, ariko akavuga ko ari Korobani; bisigura ko cagizwe inyegu y’Imana,</char> <verse eid="MRK 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 7:12" /><char style="wj">ko ivyo bituma mumwemerera kutagira ico afashisha se canke nyina.</char> <verse eid="MRK 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 7:13" /><char style="wj">Uko ni ko muhindura ijambo ry’Imana ubusa mwishimikije imigenzo mwishingiye kandi mugakora n’ibindi vyinshi bisa n’ivyo.”</char><verse eid="MRK 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 7:14" />Hanyuma Yesu yongera guhamagara rya sinzi ry’abantu ngo begere aho ari, maze arababwira ati: <char style="wj">“Nimuntege amatwi mwese, kandi mutahure:</char> <verse eid="MRK 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 7:15" /><char style="wj">Nta kintu na kimwe kija mu muntu kivuye hanze gishobora kumuhumanya; ahubwo igihumanya umuntu ni ikiva muri we.</char> [ <verse eid="MRK 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 7:16" /><char style="wj">Uwufise amatwi yumva, niyumve.”</char>]<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mu nzandiko zimwezimwe za Bibiliya aya majambo ntarimwo.</char></note><verse eid="MRK 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 7:17" />Yesu amaze kuva aho abantu bari akaja mu nzu, abigishwa biwe bamusaba ngo abasigurire uwo mugani. <verse eid="MRK 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 7:18" />Arababaza ati: <char style="wj">“Mbega namwe ntimutahura? Ntimuzi ko ico umuntu arya kidashobora kumuhumanya?</char> <verse eid="MRK 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 7:19" /><char style="wj">Kuko ntikija mu mutima wiwe, ahubwo kija mu nda yiwe, hanyuma kigasohoka.”</char> Mu kuvuga ibi, Yesu yariko yerekana ko ata vyokurya bihumanya.<verse eid="MRK 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 7:20" />Arongerako ati: <char style="wj">“Ibiva mu muntu ni vyo bimuhumanya.</char> <verse eid="MRK 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 7:21" /><char style="wj">Kuko imbere mu mutima w’umuntu ari ho hava ivyiyumviro bibi, ingeso mbi z’ivy’isoni nke, ubusuma, ubwicanyi,</char> <verse eid="MRK 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 7:22" /><char style="wj">ubusambanyi, gukunda ibintu kurenze urugero, ubukozi bw’ikibi, ubugunge, kwipfuza kurenze urugero, kwipfuza ivy’abandi, gutukana, ubwibone, n’ubupfu.</char> <verse eid="MRK 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 7:23" /><char style="wj">Ivyo bibi vyose biva mu muntu maze bikamuhumanya.”</char><verse eid="MRK 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu ashima ukwizera kw’umugore w’i Foyinike</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 7:24" />Hanyuma y’ivyo Yesu ava i Galilaya aja mu karere kegereye igisagara ca Tiro. Nuko yinjira mu nzu kandi ntiyashaka ko hagira uwumenya ko ari ho ari; ariko ntivyakunda ko yihisha. <verse eid="MRK 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 7:25" />Ubwo nyene umugore yari afise umukobwa aboshwe n’impwemu mbi yumva ko Yesu ari ho ari. Aca araza yikubita imbere y’ibirenge vyiwe. <verse eid="MRK 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 7:26" />Uwo mugore yari Umugirikikazi yavukiye i Foyinike muri Siriya. Nuko yinginga Yesu ngo yirukane impwemu mbi yari mu mukobwa wiwe.<verse eid="MRK 7:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 7:27" />Yesu aramubwira ati: <char style="wj">“Reka abana babanze barye bahage, kuko si vyiza gufata ivyokurya vy’abana ukabiterera utubwa.”</char><verse eid="MRK 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 7:28" />Na we aramwishura ati: “Mwami, n’utubwa na two turarya utwo abana bakororeye musi y’imeza.”<verse eid="MRK 7:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 7:29" />Yesu aramwishura ati: <char style="wj">“Ko wishuye uko, niwitahire; ya mpwemu mbi yavuye mu mukobwa wawe.”</char><verse eid="MRK 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 7:30" />Nuko arataha asanga umwana wiwe aryamye ku buriri, ya mpwemu mbi yamuvuyemwo.<verse eid="MRK 7:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu akiza umuntu atumva kandi atavuga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 7:31" />Hanyuma Yesu ava mu karere kegereye igisagara ca Tiro aca i Sidoni imbere yo gusubira ku Kiyaga c’i Galilaya no mu karere ka Dekapolisi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Akarere kagizwe n’ibisagara cumi.</char></note>. <verse eid="MRK 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 7:32" />Ahashitse bamuzanira umuntu atumva kandi adatobora neza, binginga Yesu ngo amurambikeko ibiganza amukize.<verse eid="MRK 7:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 7:33" />Nuko Yesu aramufata, amwigiza kure y’abantu, ashira intoke ziwe mu matwi y’uwo muntu, acira amate ku ntoke ziwe maze amukora ku rurimi. <verse eid="MRK 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 7:34" />Ahanga amaso mw’ijuru, ariruhutsa, maze abwira wa muntu ati: <char style="tl"><char style="wj">“Efata!”</char></char> bisigura ngo: <char style="wj">“Zibuka”</char>. <verse eid="MRK 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 7:35" />Ubwo nyene amatwi ya wa muntu arazibuka, ururimi rwiwe ruragoboroka, aca atangura kuvuga neza.<verse eid="MRK 7:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 7:36" />Yesu ategeka abari aho kutabibwira umuntu n’umwe. Ariko uko yababuza ni ko barushiriza kubikwiragiza. <verse eid="MRK 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 7:37" />Abantu baratangara cane, bituma baguma bavuga bati: “Ivyo akora vyose biratangaje. Atuma n’ibipfamatwi vyumva, n’ibiragi bikavuga.”<verse eid="MRK 7:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MRK 8" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu agaburira abantu ibihumbi bine</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 8:1" />Muri iyo misi, abantu benshi bongera gukorana, kandi nta vyokurya bari bagisigaranye. Yesu ahamagara abigishwa biwe arababwira ati: <verse eid="MRK 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 8:2" /><char style="wj">“Aba bantu banteye ikigongwe. Tumaranye imisi itatu none raba nta vyokurya bafise.</char> <verse eid="MRK 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 8:3" /><char style="wj">Ninabarungika bashonje, bahava bagwira isari mu nzira, kuko bamwe muri bo bavuye kure.”</char><verse eid="MRK 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 8:4" />Abigishwa baramwishura bati: “None twokura hehe ivyokurya vyokwira aba bantu muri ubu bugaragwa?”<verse eid="MRK 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 8:5" />Yesu arababaza ati: <char style="wj">“Mufise imikate ingahe?”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:5">Baramwishura bati: “Indwi.”<verse eid="MRK 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 8:6" />Maze Yesu abwira ba bantu ngo bicare hasi. Afata ya mikate, ayishimira Imana, arayimanyagura, ayiha abigishwa ngo bayihe abantu, na bo babikora uko nyene. <verse eid="MRK 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 8:7" />Bari bafise kandi n’udufi duke. Na two adushimira Imana, abwira abigishwa ngo baduhe abantu. <verse eid="MRK 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 8:8" />Ba bantu bararya barahaga. Abigishwa begeranya ibiseke indwi vyuzuye utumanyu twasigaye. <verse eid="MRK 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 8:9" />Abari aho bashika ibihumbi bine. Bahejeje kurya, Yesu aca arabarungika barataha. <verse eid="MRK 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 8:10" />Ubwo nyene aca aja mu bwato n’abigishwa biwe baja mu karere k’i Dalamanuta.<verse eid="MRK 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 8:11" />Abafarisayo bumvise ko Yesu yashitse, baraza batangura kumuhaririza. Mu ntumbero yo kumugeza, bamusaba ngo akore ikimenyetso kivuye mw’ijuru. <verse eid="MRK 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 8:12" />Maze Yesu ariruhutsa cane, hanyuma ababwira ati: <char style="wj">“Mbega ni kuki abantu ba kino gihe basaba ikimenyetso? Ndababwire ukuri, nta kimenyetso nk’ico nzoha abo muri runo runganwe.”</char> <verse eid="MRK 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 8:13" />Nuko aca abasiga ngaho, atambukira mu bwato aja ku rundi ruhande rw’ikiyaga.<verse eid="MRK 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu agabisha abantu ku vyerekeye inyigisho mbi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 8:14" />Abigishwa bari bibagiye kuzana ivyokurya. Bari bafise umukate umwe gusa mu bwato. <verse eid="MRK 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 8:15" />Bariko barajabuka arabagabisha ati: <char style="wj">“Mwirinde umwambiro w’Abafarisayo n’uwa Herode.”</char><verse eid="MRK 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 8:16" />Abigishwa baca baravugana bati: “Ivyo abivuze kuko tutagira imikate.”<verse eid="MRK 8:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 8:17" />Yesu yari azi ivyo bariko baravugana, ni ko kubabwira ati: <char style="wj">“Ni kuki muvugana ku vyo kutagira imikate? N’ubu ntimurabona canke ngo mutahure? Imitima yanyu irakomantaye ku buryo idashobora gutahura?</char> <verse eid="MRK 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 8:18" /><char style="wj">Ko mufise amaso, ni kuki mutabona? Ko mufise amatwi, ni kuki mutumva? Nta kintu na kimwe mwibuka?</char> <verse eid="MRK 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 8:19" /><char style="wj">Hamwe namanyagura ya mikate itanu nkagaburira abantu ibihumbi bitanu, mwegeranije ibiseke bingahe vyuzuye utumanyu basigaje?”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:19">Baramwishura bati: “Cumi na bibiri.”<verse eid="MRK 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 8:20" />Yesu arabandanya ati: <char style="wj">“Hamwe namanyagura ya mikate indwi nkagaburira abantu ibihumbi bine, mwegeranije ibiseke bingahe vyuzuye utumanyu basigaje?”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:20">Baramwishura bati: “Indwi.”<verse eid="MRK 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 8:21" />Maze arababaza ati: <char style="wj">“N’ubu ntimuratahura?”</char><verse eid="MRK 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu akiza impumyi i Betesayida</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 8:22" />Bashitse i Betesayida, bamuzanira impumyi baramwinginga ngo amukoreko, amukize. <verse eid="MRK 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 8:23" />Nuko afata ukuboko kw’uwo ahumye amujana inyuma y’imihana. Ahejeje gucira amate ku maso y’uwo ahumye, amurambikako ibiganza, aramubaza ati: <char style="wj">“Hari ikintu ubona?”</char><verse eid="MRK 8:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 8:24" />Wa muntu areraguza, maze avuga ati: “Egome, ndabona abantu, ariko bameze nk’ibiti bigendagenda.”<verse eid="MRK 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 8:25" />Yesu yongera kurambika ibiganza ku maso y’uwo muntu, maze amaso yiwe aca urahumuka. Aca arakira rwose, abona neza. <verse eid="MRK 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 8:26" />Maze, Yesu aca aramurungika muhira, amubwira ati: <char style="wj">“Ntuce mu mihana.”</char><verse eid="MRK 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Petero avuga ko Yesu ari Kristo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 8:27" />Hanyuma y’ivyo, Yesu n’abigishwa biwe bava i Galilaya baja mu mihana yegereye i Kayisariya mu ntara yatwarwa na Filipo. Bakigenda arababaza ati: <char style="wj">“Mbega abantu bavuga ko ndi nde?”</char><verse eid="MRK 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 8:28" />Baramwishura bati: “Bamwe bavuga ko uri Yohana Umubatizi; abandi ngo uri Eliya; abandi na bo ngo uri umwe mu bavugishwa n’Imana.”<verse eid="MRK 8:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 8:29" />Arababaza ati: <char style="wj">“None mweho muvuga ko ndi nde?”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:29">Petero arishura ati: “Uri Kristo.”<verse eid="MRK 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 8:30" />Yesu aca arabihanikiriza ngo ntihagire umuntu n’umwe babwira ivyiwe.<verse eid="MRK 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu avuga ivyerekeye urupfu rwiwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 8:31" />Yesu aca atangura kubigisha ababwira ko Umwana w’Umuntu ategerezwa kubabazwa mu buryo bwinshi; akankwa n’abatware, n’abaherezi bakurubakuru, n’abigisha b’ivyagezwe; kandi ko azokwicwa hanyuma akazuka ku musi ugira gatatu. <verse eid="MRK 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 8:32" />Ivyo yabivuga mu majambo atomoye. Hanyuma Petero aramwihereranya, atangura kumwamira ku vyo yari avuze.<verse eid="MRK 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 8:33" />Yesu arahindukira araba abandi bigishwa, akankamira Petero ati: <char style="wj">“Herera inyuma yanje Satani! Ibikuraje ishinga si ivy’Imana, ni ivy’abantu.”</char><verse eid="MRK 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Gukurikira Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 8:34" />Nuko Yesu ahamagara abantu benshi bari ngaho hamwe n’abigishwa, ababwira ati: <char style="wj">“Uwushaka kuba umwigishwa wanje wese, ategerezwa kwiheba, akikorera umusaraba wiwe akankurikira.</char> <verse eid="MRK 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 8:35" /><char style="wj">Kuko uwugomba gukiza ubugingo bwiwe, azobubura. Ariko uwubuheba ku bwanje no ku bw’Ubutumwa Bwiza, azobukiza.</char> <verse eid="MRK 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 8:36" /><char style="wj">Mbega umuntu vyomumarira iki yungutse ivyo mw’isi vyose, ariko agatakaza ubugingo bwiwe?</char> <verse eid="MRK 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 8:37" /><char style="wj">Canke umuntu yotanga iki kugira ngo acungure ubugingo bwiwe?</char> <verse eid="MRK 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 8:38" /><char style="wj">Umuntu niyagira isoni zo kunyemera no kwemera amajambo yanje muri uru runganwe rw’abasambanyi n’abanyavyaha, n’Umwana w’Umuntu na we azogira isoni zo kumwemera aho azozira mu bwiza bwa Se ari kumwe n’abamarayika bera.”</char><verse eid="MRK 8:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MRK 9" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 9:1" />Maze abandanya ababwira ati: <char style="wj">“Ndababwire ukuri, bamwe mu bahagaze hano muri kano kanya ntibazopfa batabonye Ubwami bw’Imana buza mu bushobozi buhambaye.”</char><verse eid="MRK 9:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ishusho ya Yesu ihinduka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 9:2" />Haheze imisi itandatu, Yesu ajana Petero, Yakobo na Yohana abadugana ku musozi muremure aho bagumanye bari ukwa bonyene. Bari ngaho ishusho ya Yesu ihinduka babona. <verse eid="MRK 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 9:3" />Impuzu ziwe zirera cane, zica ibibatsi. Nta muntu n’umwe kw’isi yozimesuye ngo zere nk’uko. <verse eid="MRK 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 9:4" />Hanyuma baja babona Eliya na Mose imbere yabo baganira na Yesu.<verse eid="MRK 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 9:5" />Petero abwira Yesu ati: “Mwigisha, bitubereye vyiza kuba hano. Reka tuhashinge amahema atatu: iryawe, irya Mose, n’irya Eliya.” <verse eid="MRK 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 9:6" />Ntiyari azi ico avuga, kuko we na bagenziwe bari batekewe n’ubwoba.<verse eid="MRK 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 9:7" />Maze haza igicu kirabatwikira, hanyuma ijwi ryumvikanira muri nya gicu, rivuga riti: “Uwu ni Umwana wanje nkunda cane. Nimumwumvirize!”<verse eid="MRK 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 9:8" />Ako kanya nyene, baravye impande yabo, ntihagira uwundi babona atari Yesu gusa.<verse eid="MRK 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 9:9" />Bariko baramanuka bava kuri uwo musozi, Yesu arabihanikiriza ngo ntihagire umuntu n’umwe babwira ivyo babonye kugeza Umwana w’Umuntu azutse mu bapfuye. <verse eid="MRK 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 9:10" />Nuko babigumya nk’ibanga mu mitima, ariko kenshi bakabazanya ico yagomba kuvuga igihe yababwira ivyo “kuzuka mu bapfuye”.<verse eid="MRK 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 9:11" />Hanyuma baramubaza bati: “Ni kuki abigisha b’ivyagezwe bavuga ko Eliya ategerezwa kubanza kuza?”<verse eid="MRK 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 9:12" />Yesu arabishura ati: <char style="wj">“Ni ukuri, Eliya ategerezwa kubanza kuza kugira ngo asubize vyose mu buryo. None ni kuki handitswe ko Umwana w’Umuntu ategerezwa kubabazwa cane akongera agasuzugurwa?</char> <verse eid="MRK 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 9:13" /><char style="wj">Ariko ndababwire, Eliya yaramaze kuza, kandi abantu bamukoreye ivyo bishakiye, nk’uko Ivyanditswe vyera bibivuga.”</char><verse eid="MRK 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu akiza umuhungu arimwo impwemu mbi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 9:14" />Bagarutse aho abandi bigishwa bari, babona abantu benshi babakikije kandi bamwe mu bigisha b’ivyanditswe ni ho bari bari, baharira na bo. <verse eid="MRK 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 9:15" />Abo bantu bose babonye Yesu aserutse baratangara cane, biruka baja kumuramutsa.<verse eid="MRK 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 9:16" />Yesu arababaza ati: <char style="wj">“Mbega muriko muharira ku biki?”</char><verse eid="MRK 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 9:17" />Umwe muri ba bantu arishura ati: “Mwigisha, nakuzaniye umuhungu wanje, kuko aboshwe n’impwemu mbi ituma atavuga. <verse eid="MRK 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 9:18" />Ishobora kumufatira aho ari hose, ikamutura hasi, akabira ifuro mu kanwa, agahekenya amenyo, hanyuma umubiri wiwe ukadadarara.”<verse eid="MRK 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 9:19" />Yesu arabishura ati: <char style="wj">“Mwa bantu b’iki gihe, ata kwizera mufise! Mbega nkwiye kugumana namwe igihe kingana gute? Mbega nzobihanganira gushika ryari? Nimunzanire uwo mwana.”</char><verse eid="MRK 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 9:20" />Nuko bamuzanira uwo mwana. Ya mpwemu mbi ikibona Yesu, itangura kumujegeza cane, agwa hasi, arikumbagaza, abira ifuro mu kanwa.<verse eid="MRK 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 9:21" />Yesu abaza se w’uwo mwana ati: <char style="wj">“Ibi vyatanguye kumushikira ryari?”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 9:21">Na we arishura ati: “Kuva akiri umwana muto cane. <verse eid="MRK 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 9:22" />Kenshi iyo mpwemu imuta mu muriro canke mu mazi, ikagerageza kumwica. Nimba woshobora kugira ico ukoze, utugirire impuhwe udufashe.”<verse eid="MRK 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 9:23" />Yesu aravuga ati: <char style="wj">“Uvuze uti: ‘Nimba noshobora kugira ico nkoze’? Vyose bishobokera uwizera.”</char><verse eid="MRK 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 9:24" />Ubwo nyene se w’uwo mwana arasemerera ati: “Ndizera! Ariko mfasha neshe ukutizera kwanje!”<verse eid="MRK 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 9:25" />Yesu abonye ko abantu benshi baje biruka batumbereye aho bari, ategeka ya mpwemu ihumanye ati: <char style="wj">“Wa mpwemu itera uburagi n’ukutumva, va muri uwu mwana kandi ntuze wongere kumugarukamwo.”</char><verse eid="MRK 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 9:26" />Ya mpwemu ihumanye ivuza induru, ijegeza cane wa mwana, hanyuma imuvamwo. Uwo mwana aca amera nk’uwupfuye, kandi benshi bavuga bati: “Arapfuye.” <verse eid="MRK 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 9:27" />Ariko Yesu amufata ukuboko aramuhagurutsa, maze wa mwana arahagarara.<verse eid="MRK 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 9:28" />Mu nyuma y’ivyo, Yesu yinjiye mu nzu, abigishwa biwe baramubaza biherereye bati: “Ni kuki twebwe vyatunaniye kwirukana irya dayimoni?”<verse eid="MRK 9:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 9:29" />Arabishura ati: <char style="wj">“Ugusenga kwonyene ni kwo gushobora kwirukana impwemu nk’irya.”</char><verse eid="MRK 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu asubira kuvuga ibijanye n’urupfu rwiwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 9:30" />Nuko bava aho hantu baca i Galilaya. Yesu ntiyashaka ko hagira uwumenya aho bari, <verse eid="MRK 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 9:31" />kuko yashaka kugumana n’abigishwa biwe ngo abigishe. Arababwira ati: <char style="wj">“Umwana w’Umuntu agiye gutabwa mu maboko y’abantu. Bazomwica ariko ku musi ugira gatatu, azozuka.”</char> <verse eid="MRK 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 9:32" />Ariko ntibatahura ico ababwiye, kandi batinya no kugira ico babimubazako.<verse eid="MRK 9:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 9:33" />Nuko bashika i Kaperinawumu. Ashitse mu nzu abaza abigishwa biwe ati: <char style="wj">“Mbega mwariko muharira ku biki igihe twari mu nzira tuza?”</char> <verse eid="MRK 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 9:34" />Ariko ntibamwishura, kuko mu nzira bariko babazanya umukuru muri bo uwo ari we.<verse eid="MRK 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 9:35" />Yesu amaze kwicara ahamagara bamwe cumi na babiri arababwira ati: <char style="wj">“Umuntu wese ashaka kuba uwa mbere ategerezwa kuba uw’inyuma ya bose, n’umukozi wa bose.”</char><verse eid="MRK 9:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 9:36" />Nuko afata umwana mutoya amuhagarika hagati yabo, aramuterura, ababwira ati: <verse eid="MRK 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 9:37" /><char style="wj">“Umuntu wese yakira umwe muri aba bana bato mw’izina ryanje aba anyakiriye; kandi uwunyakiriye wese ntaba yakiriye jewe gusa, ahubwo aba yakiriye n’uwantumye.”</char><verse eid="MRK 9:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Uwutatugwanya aba ari ku ruhande rwacu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 9:38" />Yohana abwira Yesu ati: “Mwigisha, twabonye umuntu yirukana abadayimoni mw’izina ryawe duca turamubuza kuko atari uwo muri twebwe.”<verse eid="MRK 9:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 9:39" />Yesu aramwishura ati: <char style="wj">“Ntimukamubuze, kuko nta muntu yokora igitangaza mw’izina ryanje hanyuma ngo agaruke amvuge nabi.</char> <verse eid="MRK 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 9:40" /><char style="wj">Kuko uwutatugwanya aba ari ku ruhande rwacu.</char> <verse eid="MRK 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 9:41" /><char style="wj">Ndababwire ukuri, umuntu wese abahaye igikombe c’amazi mw’izina ryanje kuko muri aba Kristo, ntazobura kubihererwa impera.</char><verse eid="MRK 9:41" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kwirinda ibigwisha mu caha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 9:42" />
    <char style="wj">Nihagira umuntu atuma umwe muri aba bato banyizera acumura, ikimukwiye ni uko yoboherwa urusyo kw’izosi, agatererwa mu kiyaga.</char> <verse eid="MRK 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 9:43" /><char style="wj">Ukuboko kwawe nikwagutuma gucumura, nuguce. Vyokubera vyiza kwinjira mu bugingo budashira ufise ukuboko kumwe, hako winjira mu muriro utazima wa Gehinomu ufise amaboko yompi,</char> [ <verse eid="MRK 9:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 9:44" /><char style="wj">aho</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 9:44">
    <char style="wj">‘inyo zaho zidapfa,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 9:44">
    <char style="wj">n’umuriro waho utazima.’</char>]<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:44 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mu nzandiko zimwezimwe za Bibiliya aya majambo ntarimwo.</char></note><verse eid="MRK 9:44" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 9:45" />
    <char style="wj">Kandi ukuguru kwawe nikwagutuma gukora icaha, nuguce. Vyokubera vyiza kwinjira mu bugingo budashira ufise ukuguru kumwe, hako winjira mu muriro utazima wa Gehinomu ufise amaguru yompi,</char> [ <verse eid="MRK 9:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 9:46" /><char style="wj">aho</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 9:46">
    <char style="wj">‘inyo zaho zidapfa,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 9:46">
    <char style="wj">n’umuriro waho utazima.’</char>]<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:46 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mu nzandiko zimwezimwe za Bibiliya aya majambo ntarimwo.</char></note><verse eid="MRK 9:46" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 9:47" />
    <char style="wj">Ijisho ryawe niryatuma ukora icaha, rinogore, urite kure. Vyokubera vyiza kwinjira mu Bwami bw’Imana ufise ijisho rimwe, hako utererwa muri Gehinomu ufise amaso yompi,</char> <verse eid="MRK 9:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 9:48" /><char style="wj">aho</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 9:48">
    <char style="wj">‘inyo zaho ntizipfa,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 9:48">
    <char style="wj">n’umuriro waho ntuzima.’</char>
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">9:48 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">
        <char style="xt">
          <ref loc="ISA 66:24">Yesaya 66:24</ref>
        </char>
      </char>
    </note><verse eid="MRK 9:48" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 9:49" />
    <char style="wj">Umuntu wese azosuzumwa n’umuriro.</char><verse eid="MRK 9:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 9:50" />
    <char style="wj">Umunyu ni ngirakamaro. Ariko iyo utakaje uburyohe bwawo, mbega bwosubiramwo gute? Mugire uburyohe nka kurya kw’umunyu muri mwebwe kandi mubane amahoro.”</char><verse eid="MRK 9:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MRK 10" />
  <para style="s1">Ukwahukana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 10:1" />Nuko Yesu ava i Kaperinawumu aja mu ntara ya Yudaya, hakurya y’uruzi Yorodani. Na ho nyene abantu benshi baragenda aho ari, aca arabigisha nk’uko yamenyereye.<verse eid="MRK 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 10:2" />Bamwe mu Bafarisayo baraza bagerageza kumutega umutego, baramubaza bati: “Mbega biremewe ko umugabo yahukana n’umugore wiwe?”<verse eid="MRK 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 10:3" />Arabishura ati: <char style="wj">“Mbega ivyagezwe vya Mose bitegeka iki?”</char><verse eid="MRK 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 10:4" />Baramwishura bati: “Mose yaremeye ko umuntu ashobora guha umugore wiwe urwandiko rwemeza ko bahukanye hanyuma akamwirukana.”<verse eid="MRK 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 10:5" />Yesu arabishura ati: <char style="wj">“Yanditse ico cagezwe kuko imitima yanyu ikomantaye.</char> <verse eid="MRK 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 10:6" /><char style="wj">Ariko Imana yaremye ‘umugabo n’umugore kuva mu ntango y’irema.’</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 1:27">Itanguriro 1:27</ref></char></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 10:7" /><char style="wj">‘Ni co gituma umugabo azosiga se na nyina akabana n’umugore wiwe,</char> <verse eid="MRK 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 10:8" /><char style="wj">maze bakaba umubiri umwe’</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 2:24">Itanguriro 2:24</ref></char></char></note><char style="wj">; kuko baba batakiri babiri, ahubwo baba babaye umubiri umwe.</char> <verse eid="MRK 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 10:9" /><char style="wj">None rero ico Imana yamatanije, ntihakagire uwukimatanura.”</char><verse eid="MRK 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 10:10" />Bashitse mu nzu, abigishwa basubira kubaza Yesu ku bijanye n’ukwahukana. <verse eid="MRK 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 10:11" />Arabishura ati: <char style="wj">“Umuntu wese yirukana umugore wiwe akarongora uwundi, aba asambanye, kandi aba acumuye kuri uwo wa mbere.</char> <verse eid="MRK 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 10:12" /><char style="wj">Kandi iyo umugore yahukanye n’umugabo wiwe akarongorwa n’uwundi mugabo, na we nyene aba asambanye.”</char><verse eid="MRK 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu ahezagira abana bato</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 10:13" />Umusi umwe, abavyeyi bazanye abana babo aho Yesu ari kugira ngo abarambikeko ibiganza. Ariko abigishwa barabakankamira. <verse eid="MRK 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 10:14" />Yesu abibonye, arababara. Abwira abigishwa biwe ati: <char style="wj">“Nimureke abana bato baze aho ndi, ntimubabuze, kuko Ubwami bw’Imana ari ubw’abameze nka bo.</char> <verse eid="MRK 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 10:15" /><char style="wj">Ndababwire ukuri, umuntu wese atakira Ubwami bw’Imana nk’umwana muto ntazokwigera abwinjiramwo.”</char> <verse eid="MRK 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 10:16" /><char style="wj">Nuko aterura ba bana, abarambikako ibiganza, arabahezagira.</char><verse eid="MRK 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Umutunzi n’Ubwami bw’Imana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 10:17" />Yesu afashe urugendo rwiwe aja i Yerusalemu, haza umuntu yiruka aja iyo ari, apfukama imbere yiwe, aramubaza ati: “Mwigisha mwiza, nokora iki kugira ngo nze ndagwe ubugingo budashira?”<verse eid="MRK 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 10:18" />Yesu aramwishura ati: <char style="wj">“Unyitira iki mwiza? Nta mwiza ahari, kiretse Imana yonyene.</char> <verse eid="MRK 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 10:19" /><char style="wj">Urazi ko amabwirizwa avuga ngo: ‘Ntukice, ntugasambane, ntukibe, ntukagirize abandi ibinyoma, ntukibe, wubahe so na nyoko.’</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 20:12-16">Kuvayo 20:12-16</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:16-20">Gusubiramwo 5:16-20</ref></char></char></note><char style="wj">”</char><verse eid="MRK 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 10:20" />Wa muntu yishura ati: “Ayo yose nayakurikije kuva nkiri muto.”<verse eid="MRK 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 10:21" />Yesu aramuraba yumva aramukunze. Aramubwira ati: <char style="wj">“Hari ikintu kimwe ugihajije. Genda ugurishe ivyo utunze vyose, maze amahera ukuyemwo uyahe aboro; ni ho uzoronka ubutunzi mw’ijuru, hanyuma uze unkurikire.”</char><verse eid="MRK 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 10:22" />Wa muntu avyumvise aca arijirirwa, agenda ababaye kuko yari afise ubutunzi bwinshi cane.<verse eid="MRK 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 10:23" />Yesu arahindukira abwira abigishwa biwe ati: <char style="wj">“Biragoye cane ko abatunzi binjira mu Bwami bw’Imana!”</char><verse eid="MRK 10:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 10:24" />Abigishwa batangazwa n’ayo majambo. Yesu arongera arababwira ati: <char style="wj">“Bana nkunda, biragoye cane kwinjira mu Bwami bw’Imana!</char> <verse eid="MRK 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 10:25" /><char style="wj">Vyokworoha ko ingamiya ica mu gatoboro k’urushinge rwo kubarira kurusha ko umutunzi yinjira mu Bwami bw’Imana.”</char><verse eid="MRK 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 10:26" />Ivyo vyarushirije gutangaza abigishwa, maze baravugana bati: “None ni nde ashobora gukizwa?”<verse eid="MRK 10:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 10:27" />Yesu arabitegereza, hanyuma ababwira ati: <char style="wj">“Ku bantu, ntibishoboka; ariko ku Mana, vyose birashoboka.”</char><verse eid="MRK 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 10:28" />Maze Petero aramubwira ati: “Twebwe twasize vyose turagukurikira!”<verse eid="MRK 10:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 10:29" />Yesu na we arabishura ati: <char style="wj">“Ndababwire ukuri, nta muntu n’umwe yasize inzu, abavukanyi, se canke nyina, abana canke amatongo yiwe kubera Ubutumwa Bwiza,</char> <verse eid="MRK 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 10:30" /><char style="wj">atazobishumbushwa incuro ijana muri iki gihe: inzu, abavukanyi, abavyeyi, abana n’amatongo, hamwe no guhamwa. Kandi mu gihe kizoza akazoronka ubugingo budashira.</char> <verse eid="MRK 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 10:31" /><char style="wj">Ariko benshi mu bari imbere bazoba ab’inyuma, abari inyuma na bo bazoba ab’imbere.”</char><verse eid="MRK 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu avuga ubugira gatatu ivyerekeye urupfu rwiwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 10:32" />Bari mu nzira baduga i Yerusalemu, Yesu agendera imbere y’abigishwa biwe kandi bari bahagaritse imitima, ndetse n’abagendana na bo bari bafise ubwoba. Nuko Yesu yihereranya bamwe cumi na babiri, yongera kubabwira ibigiye kumubako. <verse eid="MRK 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 10:33" />Arababwira ati: <char style="wj">“Ehe turaduze i Yerusalemu, aho Umwana w’Umuntu azotangwa agahabwa abaherezi bakurubakuru n’abigisha b’ivyagezwe. Bazomucira urubanza rwo gupfa hanyuma bamushikirize abanyamahanga,</char> <verse eid="MRK 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 10:34" /><char style="wj">na bo bazomucokora, bamucireko amate, bamukubite, hanyuma bamwice. Ariko inyuma y’imisi itatu azozuka.”</char><verse eid="MRK 10:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ico Yakobo na Yohana basavye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 10:35" />Yakobo na Yohana, bene Zebedayo, baza aho Yesu ari. Bamubwira bati: “Mwigisha, turakwinginze udukorere ico tugusaba.”<verse eid="MRK 10:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 10:36" />Arababaza ati: <char style="wj">“Mushaka ko ndabakorera iki?”</char><verse eid="MRK 10:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 10:37" />Baramwishura bati: “Niwicara ku ntebe yawe y’ubwami mu bwiza bwawe, uze utwicarike, umwe i buryo bwawe, uwundi i bubamfu bwawe.”<verse eid="MRK 10:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 10:38" />Yesu arabishura ati: “Ntimuzi ico muriko murasaba! Mbega mwoshobora kunywa ku gikombe ngiye kunywako canke kubatizwa umubatizo ngiye kubatizwa?”<verse eid="MRK 10:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 10:39" />Baramwishura bati: “Egome twobishobora.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:39">Yesu arababwira ati: <char style="wj">“Ni ivy’ukuri muzonywa ku gikombe ngiye kunywerako kandi muzobatizwa umubatizo ngiye kubatizwa,</char> <verse eid="MRK 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 10:40" /><char style="wj">ariko ibijanye no kwicara i buryo canke i bubamfu bwanje si jewe ndabitanga. Ivyo bibanza ni ivy’ababiteguriwe.”</char><verse eid="MRK 10:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 10:41" />Bamwe cumi bandi bavyumvise bashavurira Yakobo na Yohana. <verse eid="MRK 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 10:42" />Yesu aca arabahamagara bose ababwira ati: <char style="wj">“Murazi ko abatware b’amahanga batwaza umukazo abantu babo, kandi ko babaganza babacinyiza.</char> <verse eid="MRK 10:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 10:43" /><char style="wj">Uko si ko bikwiye kumera muri mwebwe. Uwushaka kuba mukuru muri mwebwe ategerezwa kuba umukozi wanyu,</char> <verse eid="MRK 10:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 10:44" /><char style="wj">kandi uwushaka kuba uwa mbere akwiye kuba umugurano wa bose.</char> <verse eid="MRK 10:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 10:45" /><char style="wj">Kuko n’Umwana w’Umuntu ntiyazanywe no gukorerwa, ahubwo yazanywe no gukorera abandi no gutanga ubuzima bwiwe ngo bube incungu ya benshi.”</char><verse eid="MRK 10:45" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu ahumura Barutimayo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 10:46" />Nuko Yesu n’abigishwa biwe bashika i Yeriko, hanyuma bava muri ico gisagara bari kumwe n’isinzi ry’abantu. I ruhande y’inzira hari impumyi yitwa Barutimayo, mwene Timayo, yari yicaye asegerereza. <verse eid="MRK 10:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 10:47" />Yumvise ko ari Yesu w’i Nazareti ariko ararengana, atangura gusemerera ati: “Yesu, Mwana wa Dawidi, ngirira imbabazi!”<verse eid="MRK 10:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 10:48" />Abantu benshi baramuzibiza bati: “Hora!” Ariko arushiriza gusemerera ati: “Mwana wa Dawidi, ngirira imbabazi!”<verse eid="MRK 10:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 10:49" />Yesu aca arahagarara, avuga ati: <char style="wj">“Nimumumpamagarire.”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:49">Nuko baramuhamagara bati: “Humura! Haguruka, araguhamagaye!” <verse eid="MRK 10:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 10:50" />Uwo ahumye aca ata impuzu ziwe, arabaduka aja aho Yesu ari.<verse eid="MRK 10:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 10:51" />Yesu aramubaza ati: <char style="wj">“Ushaka ko ngukorera iki?”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:51">Na we ati: “Mwigisha, ndashaka guhumuka.”<verse eid="MRK 10:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 10:52" />Yesu aca avuga ati: <char style="wj">“Igire, ukwizera kwawe kuragukijije.”</char> Ubwo nyene aca arahumuka, akurikira Yesu.<verse eid="MRK 10:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MRK 11" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu yinjira i Yerusalemu nk’Umwami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 11:1" />Bariko baregereza i Yerusalemu, Yesu n’abigishwa biwe bashika ahitwa Betifage n’i Betaniya ku Musozi wa Elayono. Yesu atuma babiri mu bigishwa biwe, <verse eid="MRK 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 11:2" />arababwira ati: <char style="wj">“Nimugende muri iriya mihana iri imbere yanyu; nimwashikayo, murahasanga inyana y’indogoba iziritse ata muntu n’umwe arayigenderako. Muce muyizitura muyizane hano.</char> <verse eid="MRK 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 11:3" /><char style="wj">Nihagira uwubabaza ati: ‘Ivyo mukora ni ibiki?’ Mumwishure muti: ‘Umwami arayikeneye’ kandi aca ayibasubiza adatevye.”</char><verse eid="MRK 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 11:4" />Nuko baragenda basanga inyana y’indogoba ihagaze mu nzira, iziritse imbere y’irembo. Bariko barayizitura, <verse eid="MRK 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 11:5" />bamwe mu bantu bari bahagaze aho barababaza bati: “Ivyo mukora ni ibiki? Kuki muzitura iyo nyana y’indogoba?” <verse eid="MRK 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 11:6" />Na bo babishura nk’uko Yesu yababwiye, maze barabareka barayijana. <verse eid="MRK 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 11:7" />Nuko baca bayizanira Yesu, bayisasako impuzu zabo, na we ayicarako. <verse eid="MRK 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 11:8" />Maze abantu benshi basasa impuzu zabo mu nzira, abandi na bo basasa amashami y’ibiti baciye ku misozi. <verse eid="MRK 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 11:9" />Abari imbere ya Yesu n’abari inyuma yiwe bagenda barasemerera bavuga bati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 11:9">“Hozana!”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni ijambo ry’Igiheburayo risigura ngo “Dukize!” Ariko ryahavuye rikoreshwa mu gushimagiza Imana.</char></note></para>
  <para style="b" vid="MRK 11:9" />
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 11:9">“Hahezagirwe uwuje mw’izina ry’Uhoraho!”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 118:25">Zaburi 118:25</ref>,<ref loc="PSA 118:26">26</ref></char></char></note><verse eid="MRK 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 11:10" />“Hahezagirwe ubwami bwa sogokuruza Dawidi buje!”</para>
  <para style="b" vid="MRK 11:10" />
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 11:10">“Hozana hejuru mw’ijuru!”<verse eid="MRK 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 11:11" />Nuko Yesu ashitse mu gisagara i Yerusalemu, aja mu rusengero. Amaze kwihweza ivy’aho, aca arasohoka asubirana i Betaniya na bamwe cumi na babiri, kuko bwari bwije.<verse eid="MRK 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu avuma igiti c’umusukoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 11:12" />Ku musi ukurikira, bariko baragenda bava i Betaniya, Yesu yumva arashonje. <verse eid="MRK 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 11:13" />Akiri kure abona igiti c’umusukoni gitotahaye, aca aja kuraba ko hari ivyamwa gifise. Agishikiriye ntiyagira icamwa agisangako, atari amababi kuko kitari igihe caco co kwama. <verse eid="MRK 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 11:14" />Maze abwira ico giti ati: <char style="wj">“Ntugasubire kwama na rimwe!”</char> Ivyo yabivuze abigishwa biwe bumva.<verse eid="MRK 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 11:15" />Yesu ashitse i Yerusalemu, yinjira mu rusengero atangura kwirukana abadandaza n’abariko barabagurira. Ahenagura imeza z’abavunja amahera hamwe n’intebe z’abadandaza inuma, <verse eid="MRK 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 11:16" />ntiyemerera umuntu n’umwe kwinjiza ibidandazwa mu rusengero. <verse eid="MRK 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 11:17" />Nuko aca arabigisha ati: <char style="wj">“Mbega Ivyanditswe ntibivuga ngo: ‘Inzu yanje izoba iyo gusengerwamwo n’amahanga yose’</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 56:7">Yesaya 56:7</ref></char></char></note> <char style="wj">? Ariko mweho mwayihinduye ‘ubwihisho bw’ibisuma.’</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="JER 7:11">Yeremiya 7:11</ref></char></char></note><char style="wj">”</char><verse eid="MRK 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 11:18" />Abaherezi bakurubakuru n’abigisha b’ivyagezwe bavyumvise baca batangura kurondera ingene bomwica. Ariko baramutinya kuko abantu bakunda cane inyigisho ziwe.<verse eid="MRK 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 11:19" />Bugorovye, Yesu n’abigishwa biwe barasohoka bava mu gisagara.<verse eid="MRK 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 11:20" />Bukeye mu gitondo, bariko baragenda, babona ca giti c’umusukoni Yesu yavuma cumye kuva mu mizi. <verse eid="MRK 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 11:21" />Petero aca aravyibuka maze abwira Yesu ati: “Mwigisha, ehe ca giti wavuma cumye!”<verse eid="MRK 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 11:22" />Yesu aca ababwira ati: <char style="wj">“Mukomere mu kwizera Imana.</char> <verse eid="MRK 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 11:23" /><char style="wj">Ndababwire ukuri, umuntu yobwira uwu musozi ati: ‘Shinguka, witerere mu kiyaga,’ avyizeye adakekeranya mu mutima wiwe ariko yizeye ko ivyo avuze biba, vyogenda nk’uko yabisavye.</char> <verse eid="MRK 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 11:24" /><char style="wj">Ni co gituma ndababwira ko ico muzosaba cose mu gusenga, mukwiye kwizera ko mwamaze kukironka, kandi Imana izokibaha.</char> <verse eid="MRK 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 11:25" /><char style="wj">Ariko imbere y’uko mutangura gusenga, mubanze muharire umuntu wese yabacumuyeko, kugira ngo So wo mw’ijuru na we abaharire ivyaha vyanyu.</char> [ <verse eid="MRK 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 11:26" /><char style="wj">Ariko nimutaharira abandi, na So wo mw’ijuru ntazobaharira ivyaha mwakoze.</char>]<char style="wj">”</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mu nzandiko zimwezimwe za Bibiliya aya majambo ntarimwo.</char></note><verse eid="MRK 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Babaza Yesu aho ubushobozi bwiwe buva</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 11:27" />Nuko Yesu n’abigishwa biwe basubira i Yerusalemu. Yesu ariko aragendagenda mu rusengero, abaherezi bakurubakuru, abigisha b’ivyagezwe, n’abakuru b’Abayuda baza aho ari, <verse eid="MRK 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 11:28" />baramubaza bati: “Ni ubuhe bubasha butuma ukora ivyo? Ni nde yabuguhaye?”<verse eid="MRK 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 11:29" />Yesu arabishura ati: <char style="wj">“Reka nanje ndababaze ikibazo kimwe; munyishure, nce ndababwira aho ububasha butuma nkora ibi buva.</char> <verse eid="MRK 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 11:30" /><char style="wj">Mbega umubatizo wa Yohana wavuye mw’ijuru ku Mana canke ku bantu? Nimunyishure.”</char><verse eid="MRK 11:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 11:31" />Baravugana hagati yabo bati: “Nitwavuga tuti: ‘Wavuye mw’ijuru,’ ahava atubaza ati: ‘None ni kuki mutizeye ivyo Yohana yavuze?’ <verse eid="MRK 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 11:32" />Kandi ntitwovuga tuti: ‘Wavuye ku bantu.’ ” Kuko baratinya isinzi ry’abantu bari aho, kuko abantu bose baremera ko Yohana yari uwuvugishwa n’Imana.<verse eid="MRK 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 11:33" />Ni ko kwishura Yesu bati: “Ntituzi aho wavuye.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 11:33">Na we aca ababwira ati: <char style="wj">“Nanje sindababwira aho ububasha butuma nkora ibi buva.”</char><verse eid="MRK 11:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MRK 12" />
  <para style="s1">Umugani w’ababikijwe uruzabibu babi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 12:1" />Nuko Yesu atangura kubigisha akoresheje imigani. Arababwira ati: <char style="wj">“Umuntu yateye imizabibu mw’itongo ryiwe, ararizitirira, yimba ikinogo co kuganiramwo imizabibu, yubaka n’umunara wo gucungererako urwo ruzabibu. Hanyuma azeza uwo murima abarimyi, afata urugendo rwa kure.</char> <verse eid="MRK 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 12:2" /><char style="wj">Iyimbura rigeze, atuma umukozi wiwe kuri ba barimyi gutora igice c’umwimbu kimwegukira.</char> <verse eid="MRK 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 12:3" /><char style="wj">Ba barimyi bafata uwo mukozi, baramukubita, bamurungika iminwe misa.</char> <verse eid="MRK 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 12:4" /><char style="wj">Yongera arungika uwundi mukozi, na we baramucokora, bongera bamukubita mu mutwe.</char> <verse eid="MRK 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 12:5" /><char style="wj">Hanyuma arungika uwundi mukozi, uwo we baca baramwica. Yarungitse abakozi benshi, bamwe barabakubita, abandi barabica.</char><verse eid="MRK 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 12:6" />
    <char style="wj">Umuhungu wiwe akunda cane ni we yari asigaranye yashobora gutuma. Nuko amurungika ubwa nyuma yibwira ati: ‘Umuhungu wanje we bazomusonera.’</char><verse eid="MRK 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 12:7" />
    <char style="wj">Ariko ba barimyi bamubonye baravugana bati: ‘Uwu ni we azoba samuragwa. Reka tumwice kugira ngo twegukire ivyo yorazwe.’</char> <verse eid="MRK 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 12:8" /><char style="wj">Nuko baca baramufata, baramwica, bamukwegera inyuma y’umurima w’uruzabibu.</char><verse eid="MRK 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 12:9" />
    <char style="wj">None mwibaza ko nyene uruzabibu niyaza azobagira gute? Azoza yice abo barimyi, maze urwo ruzabibu aruzeze abandi.</char> <verse eid="MRK 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 12:10" /><char style="wj">Mbega ntimurasoma aya majambo yo mu Vyanditswe avuga ngo:</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:10">
    <char style="wj">‘Ibuye abubatsi bagaye,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 12:10">
    <char style="wj">ni ryo ryahindutse irigumya imfuruka;</char><verse eid="MRK 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 12:11" />
    <char style="wj">ibi Uhoraho ni we yabikoze,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 12:11">
    <char style="wj">kandi ni igitangaza mu maso yacu’</char>
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">12:11 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">
        <char style="xt">
          <ref loc="PSA 118:22">Zaburi 118:22</ref>,<ref loc="PSA 118:23">23</ref></char>
      </char>
    </note>
    <char style="wj">?”</char><verse eid="MRK 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 12:12" />Nuko abaherezi bakurubakuru, abigisha b’ivyagezwe n’abakuru b’ubwo bwoko barondera ingene bomufata kuko bari batahuye ko ari bo yariko aravuga muri uwo mugani. Ariko barabitinya kubera abantu, baca bamusiga ngaho baragenda.<verse eid="MRK 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Gutanga ikori rya Kayisari</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 12:13" />Mu nyuma abakuru b’idini barungika bamwe mu Bafarisayo bari kumwe n’abashigikiye Herode Antipa kugira ngo batege umutego Yesu, bamufatire ku majambo avuga. <verse eid="MRK 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 12:14" />Baza aho ari baramubaza bati: “Mwigisha, turazi ko uri umuntu w’imvugakuri. Wewe ntutinya igitsure c’abantu, kuko ntuterwa ubwoba n’igihagararo cabo, ahubwo wigisha inzira ihimbara Imana mu kuri kwose. None tubwire: Biremewe gutanga ikori rija kwa Kayisari canke ntivyemewe? <verse eid="MRK 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 12:15" />Dukwiye kuritanga canke ntidukwiye kuritanga?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:15">Ariko kuko Yesu yari azi uburyarya bwabo, arabishura ati: <char style="wj">“Ni kuki muriko mugerageza kuntega umutego? Nzanira igiceri c’idenariyo ico ndaba.”</char> <verse eid="MRK 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 12:16" />Nuko barakimuzanira. Arababaza ati: <char style="wj">“Mbega iyi shusho n’ibi vyandiko biriko ni ivya nde?”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:16">Na bo bati: “Ni ivya Kayisari.”<verse eid="MRK 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 12:17" />Na we asubizayo ati: <char style="wj">“Ivya Kayisari nimubihe Kayisari, ivy’Imana mubihe Imana.”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:17">Maze iyo nyishu irabatangaza cane.<verse eid="MRK 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ivy’abagabo n’abagore inyuma y’izuka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 12:18" />Hanyuma Abasadukayo, basanzwe bavuga ko abapfuye batazozuka, baza aho ari baramubaza bati: <verse eid="MRK 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 12:19" />“Mwigisha, Mose yaduhaye ivyagezwe bivuga ko iyo umuntu apfuye, agasiga umugore atagira abana, uwo bavukana ategerezwa kurongora uwo mupfakazi kugira ngo aronkere uruvyaro uwo yapfuye. <verse eid="MRK 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 12:20" />Rero, harigeze kuba abavukana indwi. Mukuru muri bo ararongora, ariko apfa atavyaye. <verse eid="MRK 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 12:21" />Hanyuma uwa kabiri arongora wa mupfakazi, ariko na we nyene apfa atavyaye. Umuhungu wa gatatu na we nyene bimugendera gutyo. <verse eid="MRK 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 12:22" />Bibandanya uko, ku buryo ata muhungu n’umwe yamusigaranye abana. Maze mu nyuma wa mugore na we arapfa. <verse eid="MRK 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 12:23" />None ku musi w’izuka ry’abapfuye, uwo mugore azoba uwa nde, ko yabaye umugore w’abo bose uko ari indwi?”<verse eid="MRK 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 12:24" />Yesu arabishura ati: <char style="wj">“Mwarazimiye kuko mudatahura ico Ivyanditswe bivuga, ntimumenye n’ubushobozi bw’Imana.</char> <verse eid="MRK 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 12:25" /><char style="wj">Aho abapfuye bazozukira, abantu ntibazorongora canke ngo barongorwe, kuko bazoba bameze nk’abamarayika bo mw’ijuru.</char> <verse eid="MRK 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 12:26" /><char style="wj">Ku bijanye n’izuka ry’abapfuye, mbega nta ho murasoma mu gitabu ca Mose, aho yandika ivy’igisaka caka kidatemuka, ko Imana yamubwiye iti: ‘Ndi Imana ya Aburahamu, ya Isaka, na Yakobo’</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 3:6">Kuvayo 3:6</ref></char></char></note><char style="wj">?</char> <verse eid="MRK 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 12:27" /><char style="wj">Si Imana y’abapfuye, ahubwo ni Imana y’abazima. Mwarazimiye cane!”</char><verse eid="MRK 12:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ibwirizwa rikuru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 12:28" />Umwe mu bigisha b’ivyagezwe yari ahagaze ngaho yumviriza ingene bavugana; yumvise ko Yesu yishuye neza Abasadukayo, aramubaza ati: “Ibwirizwa riruta ayandi yose ni irihe?”<verse eid="MRK 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 12:29" />Yesu aramwishura ati: <char style="wj">“Ibwirizwa riruta ayandi yose ni iri: ‘Umviriza yewe Isirayeli! Uhoraho Imana yawe, ni yo Mana imwe rudende.</char> <verse eid="MRK 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 12:30" /><char style="wj">Ukundishe Uhoraho Imana yawe umutima wawe wose, umushaha wawe wose, ubwenge bwawe bwose n’inkomezi zawe zose.’</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:30 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 6:4">Gusubiramwo 6:4</ref>,<ref loc="DEU 6:5">5</ref></char></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 12:31" /><char style="wj">Irya kabiri ni iri: ‘Ukunde mugenzawe nk’uko wikunda.’</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="LEV 19:18">Abalewi 19:18</ref></char></char></note> <char style="wj">Nta bwirizwa ryoza riruta ayo.”</char><verse eid="MRK 12:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 12:32" />Wa mwigisha w’ivyagezwe arishura ati: “Mwigisha, wishuye neza cane! Ivyo uvuze ni ukuri; ko Imana ari imwe kandi ko ata yindi iriho kiretse yo yonyene; <verse eid="MRK 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 12:33" />kandi ko dukwiye kuyikundisha imitima yacu yose, ubwenge bwacu bwose; n’inkomezi zacu zose, kandi tugakunda bagenzi bacu nk’uko twikunda. Ivyo birahambaye kurusha gushikanira Imana ayandi mashikanwa yose n’ibimazi vy’ibikoko.”<verse eid="MRK 12:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 12:34" />Yesu abonye ko yishuranye ubwenge, aramubwira ati: <char style="wj">“Nturi kure y’Ubwami bw’Imana.”</char> Inyuma y’ivyo nta muntu yasubiye kwubahuka kumubaza ibibazo.<verse eid="MRK 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kristo ni umwana wa nde?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 12:35" />Hanyuma, Yesu ariko arigisha mu rusengero, abaza ati: <char style="wj">“Mbega ni kuki abigisha b’ivyagezwe bavuga ko Kristo ari umwana wa Dawidi?</char> <verse eid="MRK 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 12:36" /><char style="wj">Dawidi ubwiwe, aho yavugishwa na Mpwemu Yera, yavuze ati:</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:36">
    <char style="wj">‘Uhoraho yabwiye Umwami wanje ati:</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 12:36">
    <char style="wj">Icara i buryo bwanje,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:36">
    <char style="wj">kugeza abansi bawe bose,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 12:36">
    <char style="wj">ndabashize musi y’ibirenge vyawe.’</char>
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">12:36 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">
        <char style="xt">
          <ref loc="PSA 110:1">Zaburi 110:1</ref>
        </char>
      </char>
    </note><verse eid="MRK 12:36" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 12:37" />
    <char style="wj">None ko Dawidi ubwiwe amwita Umwami, yoba umwana wiwe gute?”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:37">Abantu benshi bari ngaho bamwumviriza buzuye umunezero.<verse eid="MRK 12:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ivyaha vy’abigisha b’ivyagezwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 12:38" />Yesu akiriko arigisha, arongera avuga ati: <char style="wj">“Mwirinde abigisha b’ivyagezwe. Bakunda kugendagenda bambaye amakanzu maremare y’icubahiro, no kuramutswa mu cubahiro mu makoraniro y’abantu.</char> <verse eid="MRK 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 12:39" /><char style="wj">Bakunda kandi guhabwa ivyicaro vy’icubahiro mu masinagogi no mu misi mikuru y’amazimano.</char> <verse eid="MRK 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 12:40" /><char style="wj">Barya amazu y’abapfakazi bakabatwara ivyabo, kandi bakabandanya biyerekana nk’abantu beza mu gusenga amasengesho maremare. Ni co gituma bazohanwa kurusha abandi.”</char><verse eid="MRK 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ishikanwa ry’umupfakazi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 12:41" />Nuko Yesu yicara hafi y’ico batorezamwo amashikanwa mu rusengero, araba ingene abantu bashiramwo amahera y’ishikanwa. Benshi mu batunzi batanga menshi. <verse eid="MRK 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 12:42" />Ariko umupfakazi umwe araza ashiramwo ibiceri bibiri vy’agaciro gato cane.<verse eid="MRK 12:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 12:43" />Nuko Yesu ahamagara abigishwa biwe arababwira ati: <char style="wj">“Ndababwire ukuri, uwu mupfakazi w’umukene atanze ishikanwa rinini kurusha abandi bose.</char> <verse eid="MRK 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 12:44" /><char style="wj">Bose batanze ku musesekara w’ubutunzi bwabo; ariko we, mu bukene bwiwe, atanze ivyomubeshejeho vyose.”</char><verse eid="MRK 12:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MRK 13" />
  <para style="s1">Ibimenyetso vy’ukugaruka kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 13:1" />Yesu ariko arasohoka ava mu rusengero, umwe mu bigishwa biwe aramubwira ati: “Mwigisha, ehe raba izi nyubakwa n’amabuye azubatse ingene biteye igomwe!”<verse eid="MRK 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 13:2" />Yesu arabishura ati: <char style="wj">“Murabona izi nyubakwa zihambaye? Nta buye na rimwe rizosigara rigeretse ku rindi; yose azosamburirwa hasi.”</char><verse eid="MRK 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 13:3" />Hanyuma Yesu yicaye ku Musozi wa Elayono aharabana n’urusengero, Petero, Yakobo, Yohana na Andereya baramubaza biherereye bati: <verse eid="MRK 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 13:4" />“Tubwire, ivyo bizoshika ryari, kandi ni ikihe kimenyetso kizokwerekana ko bigiye gushika?”<verse eid="MRK 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 13:5" />Yesu atangura kubabwira ati: <char style="wj">“Mwiyubare ntihagire umuntu abazimiza,</char> <verse eid="MRK 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 13:6" /><char style="wj">kuko benshi bazoza mw’izina ryanje, bavuga bati: ‘Ni jewe Kristo!’ kandi bazozimiza benshi.</char> <verse eid="MRK 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 13:7" /><char style="wj">Nimwumva intambara n’inkuru zivuga ivy’intambara hirya no hino, ntimuze muhagarike imitima. Ivyo bitegerezwa gushika, ariko iherezo rya vyose ntirizoba rirashika.</char> <verse eid="MRK 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 13:8" /><char style="wj">Ihanga rizotera irindi hanga, ubwami butere ubundi bwami. Ahantu henshi kw’isi hazoba nyamugigima n’ikigoyi. Ariko ivyo bizoba ari nk’intango y’ibise.</char><verse eid="MRK 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 13:9" />
    <char style="wj">Mube maso! Bazobafata babajane imbere y’abacamanza, kandi bazobakubitira mu masinagogi. Muzohagarara imbere y’abatware n’abami muzira kuba abigishwa banje, kugira ngo munshingire intahe imbere yabo.</char> <verse eid="MRK 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 13:10" /><char style="wj">Kuko Ubutumwa Bwiza butegerezwa kubanza kuvugwa mu mahanga yose.</char> <verse eid="MRK 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 13:11" /><char style="wj">Nibabafata bakabashengeza, ntimuze muhagarikwe imitima n’ivyo muzovuga. Muze muvuge ico muzohabwa ako kanya, kuko mutazovuga ivyo mwigeneye, ariko muzovuga ivyo muhawe na Mpwemu Yera.</char><verse eid="MRK 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 13:12" />
    <char style="wj">Umuntu azotanga uwo bavukana ngo bamwice, n’umuvyeyi agirire umwana wiwe uko. Abana bazogarariza abavyeyi babo banabicishe.</char> <verse eid="MRK 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 13:13" /><char style="wj">Abantu bose bazobanka babahora izina ryanje. Ariko uwuzokwihangana gushitsa kw’iherezo azokizwa.</char><verse eid="MRK 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 13:14" />
    <char style="wj">Nimwabona ca ‘kizira gihumanya’</char>
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">13:14 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">
        <char style="xt">
          <ref loc="DAN 9:27">Daniyeli 9:27</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 11:31">11:31</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 12:11">12:11</ref></char>
      </char>
    </note> <char style="wj">gihagaze aho kidakwiye guhagarara; uwusoma natahure, abazoba bari i Yudaya baze bahungire ku misozi.</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:14 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">aho kidakwiye guhagarara: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ahera</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 13:15" /><char style="wj">Uwuzoba ari hejuru ku nzu, ntazosubire mu nzu kurondera ivyo ahungana.</char> <verse eid="MRK 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 13:16" /><char style="wj">Uwuzoba ari mu murima ntaze asubire i muhira gutora impuzu.</char> <verse eid="MRK 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 13:17" /><char style="wj">Ese ukuntu iyo misi izoba ari iy’umubabaro utagira uko ungana ku bagore bibungenze n’abazoba bonsa!</char> <verse eid="MRK 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 13:18" /><char style="wj">Musenge kugira ngo ntibize bishike mu gihe c’imbeho nyinshi cane,</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:18 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">mu gihe c’imbeho nyinshi cane </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Iki gihe Yesu yari ariko aravuga ni igihe c’imbeho nyinshi, ishobora gituma umuntu akongatara iyo atikingiye.</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 13:19" /><char style="wj">azoba ari imisi y’umubabaro n’agahinda bitigeze bibaho kuva Imana irema isi kugeza ubu, kandi bitazosubira kubaho.</char><verse eid="MRK 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 13:20" />
    <char style="wj">Iyo Umwami Imana atagabanya iyo misi, nta muntu n’umwe yorokotse. Ariko kubera abatoranijwe, iyo misi yarayigabanije.</char> <verse eid="MRK 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 13:21" /><char style="wj">Muri ico gihe nihagira umuntu ababwira ati: ‘Ehe Kristo ari hano!’ canke ngo, ‘Ehe ng’uriya!’ ntimuze muvyemere.</char> <verse eid="MRK 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 13:22" /><char style="wj">Kuko abiyita Kristo n’abavugishwa b’ibinyoma bazoza ari benshi, bakore ibimenyetso n’ibitangaza kugira ngo bishobotse bazimize n’abatoranijwe.</char> <verse eid="MRK 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 13:23" /><char style="wj">Nuko mube maso, kuko ndabibabwiye imbere y’uko bishika.</char><verse eid="MRK 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 13:24" />
    <char style="wj">Muri iyo misi, inyuma y’ayo makuba,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 13:24">
    <char style="wj">‘izuba rizocura umwijima,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 13:24">
    <char style="wj">n’ukwezi ntikuzosubira kubonesha,</char><verse eid="MRK 13:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 13:25" />
    <char style="wj">inyenyeri zizokoragurika ziva kw’ijuru,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 13:25">
    <char style="wj">kandi n’ivy’inkomezi biri mu kirere bizonyiganyizwa.’</char>
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">13:25 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">
        <char style="xt">
          <ref loc="ISA 13:10">Yesaya 13:10</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 34:4">34:4</ref></char>
      </char>
    </note><verse eid="MRK 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 13:26" />
    <char style="wj">Ni ho abantu bazobona Umwana w’Umuntu aserutse mu bicu afise ubushobozi buhambaye n’ubwiza bwinshi.</char> <verse eid="MRK 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 13:27" /><char style="wj">Azotuma abamarayika biwe bakoranye abatoranijwe na we babakuye ku mpande zine z’isi, kuva aho itangurira gushika aho amajuru aherera.</char><verse eid="MRK 13:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 13:28" />
    <char style="wj">Nimwigire ku giti c’umusukoni: iyo amashami yaco atanguye gutoha, amababi na yo agatutuza, muca mumenya ko agatasi kari hafi.</char> <verse eid="MRK 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 13:29" /><char style="wj">Nuko namwe, nimwabona ivyo vyose, muzoce mumenya neza ko ukugaruka kwiwe kuri hafi, ko ageze kw’irembo.</char> <verse eid="MRK 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 13:30" /><char style="wj">Ndababwire ukuri, abo muri runo runganwe ntibazopfa bose ivyo vyose bitarashika.</char> <verse eid="MRK 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 13:31" /><char style="wj">Ijuru n’isi bizokurwaho, ariko amajambo yanje ntazovaho.</char><verse eid="MRK 13:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nta n’umwe azi umusi n’isaha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 13:32" />
    <char style="wj">Ariko ku bijanye n’umusi canke isaha, baba abamarayika bo mw’ijuru, canke Umwana ubwiwe, nta n’umwe abizi uretse Data wenyene.</char> <verse eid="MRK 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 13:33" /><char style="wj">Nuko rero mwame mugavye, muterame, kuko mutazi aho ico gihe kizoshikira.</char> <verse eid="MRK 13:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 13:34" /><char style="wj">Ukuza kw’Umwana w’Umuntu kugereranywa n’urugendo umuntu yateguye. Agira ave i muhira, yabwiye abakozi biwe bose ivyo bategerezwa gusigara barakora, hanyuma abwira umuteramyi kuba maso.</char><verse eid="MRK 13:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 13:35" />
    <char style="wj">None rero mube maso kuko mutazi igihe nyene inzu azogarukirako; hashobora kuba ku mugoroba, mu gicugu, mw’ijoro rishira ubuca canke kare mu gitondo.</char> <verse eid="MRK 13:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 13:36" /><char style="wj">Niyaza giturumbuka, ntaze asange musinziriye.</char> <verse eid="MRK 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 13:37" /><char style="wj">Ibi ndabibwiye mwebwe, ndabibwira n’abandi bose: ‘Nimube maso!’ ”</char><verse eid="MRK 13:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MRK 14" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu asigirwa amavuta i Betaniya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 14:1" />Ico gihe hari hasigaye imisi ibiri ngo umusi mukuru wa Pasika n’umusi mukuru w’imikate itarimwo umwambiro ishike. Kandi abaherezi bakurubakuru n’abigisha b’ivyagezwe bariko barondera akaryo ko gufata Yesu mu mpisho kugira ngo bamwice. <verse eid="MRK 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 14:2" />Barumvikana bati: “Ntidukwiye kumufata mu gihe c’imisi mikuru kuko abantu bohava bagumuka.”<verse eid="MRK 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 14:3" />Ico gihe Yesu yari i Betaniya mu nzu kwa Simoni yahoze ari umunyamibembe. Ariko arafungura, haza umugore afise icupa ryiza ririmwo amavuta amota cane kandi y’igiciro kinini ahinguwe mu giti bita narada. Nuko yugurura rya cupa, asuka ya mavuta ku mutwe wa Yesu.<verse eid="MRK 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 14:4" />Bamwe mu bari aho bongorerana bababaye bati: “Ni kuki yononye ayo mavuta? <verse eid="MRK 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 14:5" />Iyo agurishwa yari kuvamwo idenariyo zirenga amajana atatu,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Amafaranga arenga impembo y’umuntu mu kiringo kingana n’umwaka.</char></note> maze ayo mahera agafasha aboro.” Uwo mugore baramunebagura cane.<verse eid="MRK 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 14:6" />Yesu arababwira ati: <char style="wj">“Mbega uwu mugore mumugorera iki? Ankoreye ikintu ciza.</char> <verse eid="MRK 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 14:7" /><char style="wj">Aboro muzokwamana, kandi murashobora kubafasha igihe cose mubishakiye. Ariko jewe ntimuzonyamana.</char> <verse eid="MRK 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 14:8" /><char style="wj">Akoze ivyo ashoboye. Asutse aya mavuta ku mubiri wanje hakiri kare, kugira ngo awutegurire guhambwa.</char> <verse eid="MRK 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 14:9" /><char style="wj">Ndababwire ukuri, kw’isi yose aho ubu Butumwa Bwiza buzovugwa, ibi akoze bizovugwa, bitume yama yibukwa.”</char><verse eid="MRK 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 14:10" />Hanyuma, Yuda Isikariyote, umwe muri ba bigishwa cumi na babiri, aja kurondera abaherezi bakurubakuru ngo bavugane ingene yobashikiriza Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 14:11" />Maze baranezerwa cane, baca bamwemerera amahera; na we aca atangura kurondera akaryo keza ko kumubashikiriza.<verse eid="MRK 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu asangira n’abigishwa biwe ubwa nyuma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 14:12" />Ku musi wa mbere w’imisi mikuru y’imikate itarimwo umwambiro, hari umugenzo wo gutanga ikimazi c’umwagazi w’intama wa Pasika. Nuko abigishwa babaza Yesu bati: “Ni hehe ugomba ko tugutegurira ivyokurya vya Pasika?”<verse eid="MRK 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 14:13" />Nuko arungika bibiri mu bigishwa biwe, arababwira ati: <char style="wj">“Nimugende mu gisagara, mu nzira muraja guhura n’umuntu yikoreye umubindi w’amazi, muce mumukurikira.</char> <verse eid="MRK 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 14:14" /><char style="wj">Ashitse aho agiye, mubwire nyene urugo ko Umwigisha ashaka kumenya ahari icumba c’abashitsi aja gusangiriramwo ivya Pasika n’abigishwa biwe.</char> <verse eid="MRK 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 14:15" /><char style="wj">Na we araja kubereka icumba kinini co hejuru, kirimwo ibikenewe vyose. Aho abe ari ho mudutegurira ivya Pasika.”</char><verse eid="MRK 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 14:16" />Nuko ba bigishwa baragenda, baja mu gisagara basanga ibintu bimeze nk’uko Yesu yabibabwiye, baca bategura ivyokurya vya Pasika.<verse eid="MRK 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 14:17" />Hageze ku mugoroba, Yesu aca arashika ari kumwe n’abigishwa biwe cumi na babiri. <verse eid="MRK 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 14:18" />Bariko barafungura, Yesu avuga ati: <char style="wj">“Ndababwire ukuri, umwe muri mwebwe turiko turasangira ahava angurisha.”</char><verse eid="MRK 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 14:19" />Abigishwa baca barababara, umwe wese aramubaza ati: “Yoba ari jewe?”<verse eid="MRK 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 14:20" />Arabishura ati: <char style="wj">“Ni umwe muri mwebwe cumi na babiri, uwo duhurije ukuboko mw’isahani.</char> <verse eid="MRK 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 14:21" /><char style="wj">Umwana w’Umuntu agiye gupfa nk’uko Ivyanditswe bivuga. Ariko aragowe uwo muntu amugurishije! Vyari kumubera vyiza iyo atavuka!”</char><verse eid="MRK 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 14:22" />Bariko barafungura, Yesu afata umukate, awushimira Imana, arawumanyura, awuha abigishwa biwe, avuga ati: <char style="wj">“Nimwakire murye, uwu ni umubiri wanje.”</char><verse eid="MRK 14:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 14:23" />Yongera afata igikombe, ahejeje kugishimira Imana, agiha abigishwa biwe, maze bose bakinywako.<verse eid="MRK 14:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 14:24" />Arababwira ati: <char style="wj">“Aya ni amaraso yanje y’isezerano hagati y’Imana n’abantu bayo, asesetse ku bwa benshi.</char> <verse eid="MRK 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 14:25" /><char style="wj">Ndababwire ukuri, sinzosubira kunywa ku muvinyu w’imizabibu gushitsa kuri wa musi aho nzosubira kuwunywa ari mushasha mu Bwami bw’Imana.”</char><verse eid="MRK 14:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 14:26" />Bahejeje kuririmba barasohoka baja ku Musozi wa Elayono.<verse eid="MRK 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu avuga ko Petero ahava amwihakana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 14:27" />Yesu arababwira ati: <char style="wj">“Mwese muhava muhunga, munte jenyene. Kuko Ivyanditswe bivuga ngo:</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 14:27">
    <char style="wj">‘Nzokubita umwungere,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 14:27">
    <char style="wj">intama zisanzare.’</char>
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">14:27 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">
        <char style="xt">
          <ref loc="ZEC 13:7">Zakariya 13:7</ref>
        </char>
      </char>
    </note><verse eid="MRK 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 14:28" />
    <char style="wj">Ariko maze kuzuka, nzobitangira imbere kuja i Galilaya, ndabarindirireyo.”</char><verse eid="MRK 14:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 14:29" />Petero aramubwira ati: “Naho bose boguta bagahunga, jewe sinzoguta.”<verse eid="MRK 14:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 14:30" />Yesu aramwishura ati: “Ndakubwire ukuri, iri joro nyene, imbere yuko isake ibika kabiri, wewe nyene uzoba umaze kunyihakana gatatu kose uvuga ko utanzi.”<verse eid="MRK 14:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 14:31" />Ariko Petero abisubiramwo ashimitse ati: “Sinshobora kukwihakana ngo sindakuzi naho vyonsaba gupfana nawe.” N’abandi bigishwa bavuga gutyo nyene.<verse eid="MRK 14:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">I Getsemane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 14:32" />Nuko baja ahantu hitwa Getsemane, maze Yesu abwira abigishwa biwe ati: <char style="wj">“Nimube muricaye ngaha nanje nje gusenga.”</char> <verse eid="MRK 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 14:33" />Nuko ajana na Petero, na Yakobo na Yohana, maze atangura kugira agahinda kenshi cane no guhagarika umutima. <verse eid="MRK 14:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 14:34" />Arababwira ati: <char style="wj">“Umutima wanje wuzuye agahinda gashobora kunyica. Nimube muragumye ngaha mubane maso nanje.”</char><verse eid="MRK 14:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 14:35" />Nuko yigira imbere, yubama hasi arasenga asaba ngo iyo saha imurengane. <verse eid="MRK 14:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 14:36" />Aravuga ati: <char style="tl"><char style="wj">“Aba,</char></char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:36 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Aba </char><char style="ft" closed="false">bisigura “Data” mu rurimi rw’Icarameya.</char></note> <char style="wj">Data, wewe vyose biragushobokera. Ndakwinginze unkure imbere iki gikombe c’imibabaro. Ariko ntibibe nk’uko jewe ngomba, yamara bibe uko wewe ugomba.”</char><verse eid="MRK 14:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 14:37" />Nuko agaruka aho abigishwa biwe bari asanga basinziriye. Abaza Petero ati: <char style="wj">“Simoni, urasinziriye? Ntiwashoboye kubana maso nanje n’isaha n’imwe?</char> <verse eid="MRK 14:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 14:38" /><char style="wj">Nimube maso musenge kugira ngo ntimutsindwe n’ibibagerageza. Umutima urabikunze, ariko umubiri ufise intege nke.”</char><verse eid="MRK 14:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 14:39" />Asubira kwigira imbere, asenga asubiramwo ya majambo nyene. <verse eid="MRK 14:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 14:40" />Agarutse, asanga basubiriye gusinzira, kuko amaso yabo yari aremerewe cane n’itiro, maze babura ico bamubwira.<verse eid="MRK 14:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 14:41" />Agarutse aho bari ubugira gatatu, arababaza ati: <char style="wj">“Mbega n’ubu muracasinziriye, muriruhukiye? Ehe, isaha irageze, Umwana w’Umuntu agira atangwe mu maboko y’abanyavyaha.</char> <verse eid="MRK 14:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 14:42" /><char style="wj">Nimuvyuke tugende. Nguwo uwangurishije arashitse!”</char><verse eid="MRK 14:42" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bafata Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 14:43" />Yesu akiriko aravuga, Yuda Isikariyote, umwe muri ba bigishwa cumi na babiri arashika. Inyuma yiwe hari isinzi ry’abantu bitwaje inkota n’amahiri, barungitswe n’abaherezi bakurubakuru n’abigisha b’ivyagezwe n’abatware.<verse eid="MRK 14:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 14:44" />Yuda, uwari yamugurishije yari yabahaye ikimenyetso, ababwira ati: “Uwo nja gusoma azoba ari we. Muce mumufata mumujane, kandi mumucunge cane!” <verse eid="MRK 14:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 14:45" />Babashikiriye, Yuda agenda atumbereye Yesu, avuga ati: “Rabi!” Aca aramusoma. <verse eid="MRK 14:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 14:46" />Nuko ba bantu bashorera amaboko kuri Yesu baramufata. <verse eid="MRK 14:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 14:47" />Umwe mu bari hafi ya Yesu asokora inkota yiwe ayikubita umukozi w’umuherezi mukuru, amuca ugutwi.<verse eid="MRK 14:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 14:48" />Yesu aravuga ati: <char style="wj">“Mbega mbaye umugumutsi, aho muza kumfata mwitwaje amahiri?</char> <verse eid="MRK 14:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 14:49" /><char style="wj">Imisi yose namana namwe mu rusengero nigisha, ariko ntimwigeze mumfata. Ariko ibi bibaye kugira ngo Ivyanditswe bishike.”</char> <verse eid="MRK 14:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 14:50" />Nuko bose baramuta barahunga.<verse eid="MRK 14:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 14:51" />Ariko umusore umwe agerageza gukurikira Yesu yambaye umutamana wonyene, na we nyene baza kumufata, <verse eid="MRK 14:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 14:52" />aca abatana wa mutamana ahunga ari gusa.<verse eid="MRK 14:52" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu imbere y’ubucamanza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 14:53" />Nuko bafata Yesu bamujana mu rugo rw’umuherezi mukuru, ahari hakoraniye abaherezi bakurubakuru, abatware, n’abigisha b’ivyagezwe. <verse eid="MRK 14:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 14:54" />Petero aguma amukurikira agendera inyuma kure, maze ashika mu rugo rw’umuherezi mukuru, aca yicarana n’abarinzi b’urugo, yota umuriro.<verse eid="MRK 14:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 14:55" />Abaherezi bakurubakuru n’abagize inama nkuru y’idini ry’Abayuda<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:55 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Inama nkuru y’idini </char><char style="ft" closed="false">bari abarongozi mirongo indwi n’umwe bari barongowe n’umuherezi mukuru.</char></note>, bagerageza kurondera ibirego vyotuma Yesu acirwa urubanza rwo gupfa, ariko ntibaronka na kimwe. <verse eid="MRK 14:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 14:56" />Bamwe mu bamwagiriza bagerageza kumubeshera, ariko ntibahuza ku vyo bamurega.<verse eid="MRK 14:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MRK 14:57" />Nuko bamwe barahaguruka bamwagiriza ibinyoma bati: <verse eid="MRK 14:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MRK 14:58" />“Twamwumvise avuga ngo: ‘Nzosambura uru rusengero rwubatswe n’abantu, hanyuma mu misi itatu nubake urundi, rutubatswe n’abantu.’ ” <verse eid="MRK 14:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MRK 14:59" />Ariko n’ivyo birego na vyo ntibabihurizako.<verse eid="MRK 14:59" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="MRK 14:60" />Hanyuma umuherezi mukuru aca arahaguruka imbere ya bose, abaza Yesu ati: “None wewe nta co wireguza? Ibi birego bakwagiriza ubivugako iki?” <verse eid="MRK 14:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MRK 14:61" />Ariko Yesu arihorera ntiyagira ico amwishura.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:61">Wa muherezi mukuru arongera aramubaza ati: “Uri Kristo, Umwana w’Iyihezagiwe?”<verse eid="MRK 14:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MRK 14:62" />Yesu arishura ati: <char style="wj">“Ndi we! Kandi muzobona Umwana w’Umuntu yicaye mu kibanza c’icubahiro i buryo bw’Imana y’ububasha, kandi azananye n’ibicu vyo kw’ijuru.”</char><verse eid="MRK 14:62" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="MRK 14:63" />Wa muherezi mukuru yitaburirako impuzu, avuga ati: “None hari ibindi vyabona dukeneye? <verse eid="MRK 14:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MRK 14:64" />Ubu naho ntimwiyumviye ingene atutse Imana? Nimugire ico mubivuzeko.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:64">Bose baca bamucira urubanza ko akwiye gupfa! <verse eid="MRK 14:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="MRK 14:65" />Bamwe batangura kumucirako; bamupfunga amaso, bamukubita ingumu, bavuga bati: “Vugishwa, utubwire uwugukubise!” Hanyuma ba barinzi baca baramujana, bamukubita amakofe.<verse eid="MRK 14:65" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Petero avuga ko atazi Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="MRK 14:66" />Petero akiri hepfo mu rugo, umwe mu bakobwa bakorera umuherezi mukuru aza aho ari. <verse eid="MRK 14:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="MRK 14:67" />Abonye Petero ariko arota, aramwihweza cane.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:67">Maze amubwira ati: “Na wewe wari kumwe na Yesu Umunyanazareti.”<verse eid="MRK 14:67" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="MRK 14:68" />Ariko Petero arabihakana ati: “Sinzi kandi sintahura ivyo uriko uravuga!” Nuko aca ava mu rugo aja kw’irembo.<verse eid="MRK 14:68" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="MRK 14:69" />Wa mukobwa abonye ko Petero ahagaze kw’irembo, aca abwira abari ngaho ati: “Uwu mugabo ni umwe mu bigishwa biwe!” <verse eid="MRK 14:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="MRK 14:70" />Petero yongera kubihakana.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:70">Haheze akanya, abari bahagaze hafi ya Petero baramubwira bati: “Ni ivy’ukuri uri umwe muri bo, kuko uri Umunyagalilaya.”<verse eid="MRK 14:70" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="MRK 14:71" />Petero atangura kurahira yisiba ati: “Ndabarahiye, uwo mugabo sindamuzi.”<verse eid="MRK 14:71" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="MRK 14:72" />Uwo mwanya nyene isake ica ibika ubugira kabiri. Nuko Petero na we aca aribuka ijambo Yesu yari yamubwiye ati: <char style="wj">“Isake itarabika kabiri, uzoba umaze kunyihakana gatatu kose, uvuga ko utanzi.”</char> Maze aca araturikisha ararira.<verse eid="MRK 14:72" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MRK 15" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu imbere ya Pilato</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 15:1" />Hakiri kare mu gatondo, abaherezi bakurubakuru hamwe n’abatware, n’abigisha b’ivyagezwe, ari bo bari bagize inama nkuru y’idini ry’Abayuda barakorana, bagira inama. Nuko baboha Yesu, bamujana kwa Pilato.<verse eid="MRK 15:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 15:2" />Pilato aramubaza ati: “Woba uri umwami w’Abayuda?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 15:2">Yesu aramwishura ati: <char style="wj">“Uvuze ukuri, ndi we.”</char><verse eid="MRK 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 15:3" />Maze abaherezi bakurubakuru bamurega ibirego vyinshi. <verse eid="MRK 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 15:4" />Pilato aramubaza ati: “Mbega nta co wishura? Mbega ntiwumva ivyo bakurega?”<verse eid="MRK 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 15:5" />Ariko Yesu ntiyagira ico yishura, bituma Pilato atangara.<verse eid="MRK 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 15:6" />Igihe cose mu misi mikuru ya Pasika, hari umugenzo wo kurekura imbohe abantu bisabiye. <verse eid="MRK 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 15:7" />Hariho umugabo yitwa Baraba yari mw’ibohero kuko we na bagenziwe bagirizwa ubwicanyi mu migumuko. <verse eid="MRK 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 15:8" />Nuko abantu baraza basaba Pilato kubarekurira imbohe nk’uko yari asanzwe abikora.<verse eid="MRK 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 15:9" />Pilato arababaza ati: “Mushaka ko ndabarekurira Umwami w’Abayuda?” <verse eid="MRK 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 15:10" />Yari azi neza ko abaherezi bakurubakuru bamuzaniye Yesu kubera ishari. <verse eid="MRK 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 15:11" />Abaherezi bakurubakuru batangura kugumura abantu ngo basabe Pilato abarekurire Baraba mu kibanza ca Yesu.<verse eid="MRK 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 15:12" />Pilato arababaza ati: “None uwo mwita umwami w’Abayuda ndamugire nte?”<verse eid="MRK 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 15:13" />Barasemerera bati: “Nabambwe!”<verse eid="MRK 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 15:14" />Pilato arababaza ati: “Kubera iki? Ni ikihe caha yakoze?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 15:14">Ariko barushiriza gusemerera bati: “Nabambwe!”<verse eid="MRK 15:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 15:15" />Mu ntumbero yo kunezereza abantu benshi bari aho, Pilato arekura Baraba. Atanga itegeko ko bashishagura Yesu, hanyuma aramutanga kugira ngo bamubambe.<verse eid="MRK 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abasoda bacokora Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 15:16" />Nuko abasoda bajana Yesu mu rugo rw’imbere; ni ukuvuga aho umutware w’Umuroma yakorera, bahamagara abandi basoda bagize umugwi wabo, <verse eid="MRK 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 15:17" />bamwambika ikanzu itukura, bajisha urugori rw’amahwa, barumwambika mu mutwe. <verse eid="MRK 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 15:18" />Nuko batangura kumucokora bati: “Turagize bwakeye, mwami w’Abayuda!” <verse eid="MRK 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 15:19" />Baguma bamukubita irenga mu mutwe, bamucirako amate. Bapfukama imbere yiwe bamushinyagurira ngo baramwubashe. <verse eid="MRK 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 15:20" />Bahejeje kumushinyagurira, bamwambura ya kanzu itukura basubira kumwambika impuzu ziwe, hanyuma bamujana kumubamba.<verse eid="MRK 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Babamba Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 15:21" />Bakiri mu nzira bagenda, bahura n’umugabo yitwa Simoni yari avuye mu mirima, bamutegeka gutwaza umusaraba Yesu. Simoni yava i Kurene<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:21 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Kurene </char><char style="ft" closed="false">cari igisagara co mu buraruko bwa Afrika.</char></note> kandi yari se wa Alegizandere na Rufu. <verse eid="MRK 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 15:22" />Nuko bashikana Yesu ahantu hitwa Gologota (bisigura “Ahantu h’Agahanga”). <verse eid="MRK 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 15:23" />Bagerageza kumuha umuvinyu w’inkarisha, ariko yanka kuwunywa. <verse eid="MRK 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 15:24" />Nuko baramubamba, bagabura impuzu ziwe bakoresheje ubupfindo kugira ngo barabe iyo umwumwe wese yotwara.<verse eid="MRK 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 15:25" />Igihe bamubamba hari nk’isaha zitatu z’igitondo. <verse eid="MRK 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 15:26" />Icandiko c’ibirego vyatumye abambwa cavuga ngo:</para>
  <para style="pc" vid="MRK 15:26">
    <char style="sc">Umwami w’Abayuda.</char><verse eid="MRK 15:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 15:27" />Ba basoda bongera babamba ibisuma bibiri i ruhande ya Yesu, kimwe i buryo, ikindi i bubamfu bwiwe. [ <verse eid="MRK 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 15:28" />Uko ni ko Ivyanditswe vyashitse kuko vyavuga ngo: “Yaharuwe mu gitigiri c’inkozi z’ikibi.”]<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mu nzandiko zimwezimwe za Bibiliya aya majambo ntarimwo.</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 15:29" />Abarengana bagenda baramutuka bamuzunguriza imitwe, bakamubwira bati: “Wewe wavuze ngo wosambura urusengero ukarwubaka mu misi itatu! <verse eid="MRK 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 15:30" />Ikize rero, wikure kuri uwo musaraba!” <verse eid="MRK 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 15:31" />N’abaherezi bakurubakuru n’abigisha b’ivyagezwe na bo bakamucokora, bavuga bati: “Yakijije abandi, ariko we ntashobora kwikiza! <verse eid="MRK 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 15:32" />Kristo, umwami w’Abisirayeli niyikure ku musaraba kugira ngo tubibone hanyuma tumwizere.” Na vya bisuma vyari bibambanywe na we na vyo biramutuka.<verse eid="MRK 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Urupfu rwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 15:33" />Kuva isaha zitandatu z’umurango, igihugu cose gitwikirwa n’umwijima gushika isaha icenda. <verse eid="MRK 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 15:34" />Isaha y’icenda ishitse, Yesu arasemerera n’ijwi rirenga ati: <char style="tl"><char style="wj">“Eloyi, Eloyi, lema sabakitani?”</char></char> bisobanurwa ngo: <char style="wj">“Mana yanje, Mana yanje, ni kuki wampevye?”</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:34 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 22:1">Zaburi 22:1</ref></char></char></note><verse eid="MRK 15:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 15:35" />Bamwe mu bari bahagaze aho baravuga bati: “Mwumvise? Ariko ahamagara Eliya!”<verse eid="MRK 15:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 15:36" />Umwe ariruka afata sipongo ayijobeka mu nkarisha, ayishira kw’irenga, aca arariduza ku munwa wa Yesu kugira ngo amunyweshe, aravuga ati: “Reka turabe ko Eliya aza kumumanura, amukure ku musaraba.”<verse eid="MRK 15:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 15:37" />Nuko Yesu araboroga, aca aracikana.<verse eid="MRK 15:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 15:38" />Igitambara co mu rusengero gica gitabukamwo kubiri kuva hejuru gushika hasi. <verse eid="MRK 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 15:39" />Intwazangabo y’Umuroma yari ahagaze imbere ya Yesu, abonye ingene apfuye, aravuga ati: “Ni ivy’ukuri uwu yari Umwana w’Imana!”<verse eid="MRK 15:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 15:40" />Ico gihe hariho abagore babirabira kure. Muri bo harimwo Mariya Magadalena, Mariya nyina wa Yakobo mutoya na Yose, hamwe na Salome. <verse eid="MRK 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 15:41" />Abo bagore bagendana na Yesu igihe yari i Galilaya bakamushigikira. Hari n’abandi bagore benshi bari bazananye na we i Yerusalemu bari ngaho.<verse eid="MRK 15:41" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bahamba Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 15:42" />Uwo musi wari uwo kwitegurira Isabato, ni ukuvuga buca haba Isabato. Nuko hageze ku mugoroba, <verse eid="MRK 15:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 15:43" />Yosefu w’i Arimataya, arahaguruka n’ubutwari bwinshi, aja kwa Pilato amusaba ikiziga ca Yesu. Uwo Yosefu yari umwubahwa mu bagize inama nkuru y’ubwoko bw’Abayuda kandi yari yiteze ukuza kw’Ubwami bw’Imana. <verse eid="MRK 15:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 15:44" />Pilato aca aratangara yumvise ko Yesu yamaze gucikana. Nuko ahamagara ya ntwazangabo y’Umuroma amubaza ko Yesu yamaze gupfa. <verse eid="MRK 15:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 15:45" />Na we amubwira ko ari vyo. Pilato aca aha uruhusha Yosefu rwo gutora ikiziga ca Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 15:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 15:46" />Maze Yosefu aca agura igitambara cera, akura ikiziga ca Yesu ku musaraba, akizingira muri ico gitambara cera, agishira mu mva yimbwe mu gitandara; aca atembagariza ikibuye kinini ku muryango wa ya mva arayugara. <verse eid="MRK 15:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 15:47" />Kandi ico gihe Mariya Magadalena na Mariya nyina wa Yose bariko bararaba aho bashize ikiziga ca Yesu.<verse eid="MRK 15:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MRK 16" />
  <para style="s1">Ukuzuka kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 16:1" />Isabato iheze, Mariya Magadalena, Mariya nyina wa Yakobo na Salome baja kugura amavuta amota neza, ngo baje kuyasiga umubiri wa Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 16:2" />Kare mu gitondo ku musi wa mbere utangura iyinga, izuba riserutse, bafata inzira baja ku mva. <verse eid="MRK 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 16:3" />Bariko baragenda barabazanya bati: “Ni nde aja kudukurira ca kibuye ku muryango w’imva?”<verse eid="MRK 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 16:4" />Ariko bahashitse, bararaba babona ca kibuye camaze kuvaho. <verse eid="MRK 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 16:5" />Binjiye mu mva, babona umuntu asa n’umusore yambaye ikanzu yera cane, yicaye ku ruhande rw’i buryo, maze bagira ubwoba.<verse eid="MRK 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 16:6" />Na we arabaremesha ati: “Ntimugire ubwoba! Ndazi ko murondera Yesu w’i Nazareti, umwe babamba. Ntari hano kuko yazutse! Nimuze murabe aho bari baryamitse ikiziga ciwe! <verse eid="MRK 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 16:7" />Nimugende mubibwire abigishwa biwe, na canecane Petero, ko Yesu agiye kubarindirira i Galilaya. Aho ni ho muzomubonera nk’uko yabibabwiye.”<verse eid="MRK 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 16:8" />Nuko ba bagore barasohoka barahunga baja kure ya ya mva bajugumira kandi bazazaniwe, ntibagira n’umwe babibwira kuko bari bafise ubwoba bwinshi.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="MRK 16:8" />
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 16:8">[ <verse eid="MRK 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 16:9" />Yesu amaze kuzuka, mu gatondo ku musi wa mbere w’indwi, yabanje kwiyereka Mariya Magadalena, uwo yari yarirukanyemwo abadayimoni indwi. <verse eid="MRK 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 16:10" />Na we aca aja kubwira abigishwa iyo nkuru. Abigishwa bari bakigandaye, bamuririra. <verse eid="MRK 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 16:11" />Naho bari bumvise ko Yesu ari muzima kandi ko yamwiboneye, ntibizeye ivyo ababwiye.<verse eid="MRK 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 16:12" />Inyuma y’aho Yesu arongera yiyereka, mu bundi buryo, babiri bo muri bo bariko baja mu gihugu hagati. <verse eid="MRK 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 16:13" />Maze baca baragaruka babibwira abandi, ariko na bo nyene ntibizera ivyo bababwiye.<verse eid="MRK 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 16:14" />Mu nyuma Yesu yiyereka bamwe cumi n’umwe bariko barasangira. Arabahambarira kubera ukutizera n’ugukomantaza imitima kwabo kuko banse kwemera ivyo babwiwe n’abamubonye amaze kuzuka.<verse eid="MRK 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 16:15" />Arababwira ati: <char style="wj">“Nimugende mw’isi yose, mubwire Ubutumwa Bwiza abaremwe bose.</char> <verse eid="MRK 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 16:16" /><char style="wj">Uwizera wese akabatizwa azokizwa, ariko uwutizera azocirwa urubanza.</char> <verse eid="MRK 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 16:17" /><char style="wj">Kandi ibi ni vyo bimenyetso bizoboneka ku bizera: bazokwirukana abadayimoni mw’izina ryanje, bazovuga indimi nshasha,</char> <verse eid="MRK 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 16:18" /><char style="wj">bazofata inzoka mu biganza vyabo; kandi nibanywa ivyica, nta co bizobagira. Bazorambika ibiganza ku bagwaye, kandi bazokira.”</char><verse eid="MRK 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 16:19" />Umwami Yesu ahejeje kubabwira ivyo, aca aduzwa mw’ijuru, yicara mu kibanza c’icubahiro i buryo bw’Imana. <verse eid="MRK 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 16:20" />Hanyuma abigishwa baca baja mu mihingo yose bavuga Ubutumwa Bwiza, kandi Umwami Yesu akorana na bo, ashingira intahe Ijambo ryiwe biciye mu bitangaza vyarikurikira.]<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:9-20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mu nzandiko zimwezimwe za Bibiliya aya majambo ntarimwo.</char></note><verse eid="MRK 16:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 16" />
</usx>